scription":"This entry from the original catalogue is awaiting verification before publication.","description_fr":"Cette entrée du catalogue initial reste à vérifier avant publication.","tags":["Bowling","Arcade","Extracurricular","Family Friendly","Nightlife"],"sources":[],"access":"unknown","published":false},{"id":16,"name":"Acro''Kart","type":"activity","lat":14.53487636,"lng":-61.0118258,"location":"Les Trois-Îlets","description":"A 530-metre go-kart track at the Village de la Poterie in Les Trois-Îlets, run by professionals, with options for beginners and experienced drivers on 270 cc four-stroke karts. There is also a bowling area, professional timing, a night-time circuit and services for events.","description_fr":"Une piste de karting de 530 mètres au Village de la Poterie, aux Trois-Îlets, encadrée par des professionnels, avec des formules pour débutants comme pour pilotes expérimentés sur des karts 4-temps de 270 cm³. Le site propose aussi un espace bowling, du chronométrage professionnel, un circuit nocturne et des services pour événements.","tags":["Karting","Racing Carts","Extracurricular","Adrenaline","Speed"],"sources":[{"url":"https://acrokart.fr/","title":"Acro’Kart","fields":["Name","Description"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-et-decouvertes-terre/acrokart-racing-bowling","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Opening hours","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-et-decouvertes-terre/acrokart-racing-bowling","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-et-decouvertes-terre/acrokart-racing-bowling","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-et-decouvertes-terre/acrokart-racing-bowling","c