h a warm, welcoming feel. It serves traditional dishes and original recipes with Creole flavours made from fresh products, with a terrace around a swimming pool for meals with friends, family or colleagues.","description_fr":"Le restaurant de l’hôtel Frégate Bleue, au François, dans un bâtiment d’esprit créole à l’atmosphère chaleureuse. On y déguste des plats traditionnels et des recettes originales aux saveurs créoles, avec des produits frais, sur une terrasse aménagée autour de la piscine.","tags":["International"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/le-flamant-rose","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Price range","Type","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"kind":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/le-flamant-rose","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/le-flamant-rose","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/le-flamant-rose","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/le-flamant-rose","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/le-flamant-rose","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/le-flamant-rose","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/le-flamant-rose","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"kind":["Cuisine du Monde"],"phone":"+596 596 54 54 66","address":"Hotel frégate bleue, 97240 Le François","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"website":"https://www.fregatebleue.com/","languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"7–24 €"},"opening_periods":[{"day":0,"opens":1140,"closes":1320},{"day":3,"opens":1140,"closes":1320},{"day":4,"opens":1140,"closes":1320},{"day":5,"opens":1140,"closes":1320},{"day":6,"opens":1140,"closes":1320}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/le-flamant-rose","hours_updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:31:41.787375+00:00"},{"id":45,"name":"Le Jardin De La Santé","type":"restaurant","lat":14.4544522,"lng":-60.846972,"location":"Sainte-Anne","description":"A farm-to-table garden project in Sainte-Anne that combines a small organic shop selling fruit and vegetables, a restaurant, educational garden visits and guided walks around the Piton de Crève-Cœur. It also hosts cultural events that celebrate Martinique''s roots in the land.","description_fr":"Un jardin à Sainte-Anne qui réunit une petite boutique bio de fruits et légumes, un restaurant du champ à l’assiette, des visites pédagogiques du jardin et des balades autour du Piton de Crève-Cœur. Des événements culturels y célèbrent aussi l’attachement de la Martinique à sa terre.","tags":["Creole"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/le-jardin-de-la-sante","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Type","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"kind":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/le-jardin-de-la-sante","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/le-jardin-de-la-sante","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/le-jardin-de-la-sante","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/le-jardin-de-la-sante","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/le-jardin-de-la-sante","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"kind":["Cuisine traditionnelle"],"phone":"+596 696 61 52 52","address":"Lotissement Petit Versaille, Route d''Encornette, 97227 Sainte-Anne","payment":["Cartes bancaires"],"languages":["Espagnol","Français"]},"opening_periods":[{"day":2,"opens":540,"closes":960},{"day":3,"opens":540,"closes":960},{"day":4,"opens":540,"closes":960},{"day":5,"opens":540,"closes":1320},{"day":6,"opens":540,"closes":1320}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/le-jardin-de-la-sante","hours_updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:31:42.059298+00:00"},{"id":46,"name":"Le Jardin Des Alizes","type":"restaurant","lat":14.6040984,"lng":-61.079556,"location":"Fort-de-France","description":"The restaurant of the Karibea Squash hotel in Fort-de-France, serving multicultural cooking that blends local culture with outside influences, in dishes described as healthy and colourful. Guests sit in an air-conditioned room or on a terrace by the renovated pool with a view of the Baie des Flamands, and breakfast is served too.","description_fr":"Le restaurant de l’hôtel Karibea Squash, à Fort-de-France, qui propose une cuisine multiculturelle mêlant culture locale et influences venues d’ailleurs, avec des plats présentés comme sains et colorés. On s’installe dans une salle climatisée ou sur la terrasse au bord de la piscine rénovée, face à la baie des Flamands ; les petits-déjeuners y sont aussi servis.","tags":["International"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/le-jardin-des-alizes","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Social media","Price range","Type","Payment","Languages spoken","Services"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"kind":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/le-jardin-des-alizes","checkedAt":"2