"closes":870},{"day":5,"opens":1140,"closes":1290},{"day":6,"opens":690,"closes":870},{"day":6,"opens":1140,"closes":1290}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/restaurant-les-aromes","hours_updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:31:47.799152+00:00"},{"id":69,"name":"Tante Arlette","type":"restaurant","lat":14.8737277,"lng":-61.179897,"location":"Grand’Rivière","description":"A Creole house in the village of Grand''Rivière, a fishing village at the foot of Montagne Pelée in the far north and a starting point for some of the island''s best hikes. The same family has run the restaurant for three generations, serving seafood specialities such as accras made with tiny local fish and grilled lobster, with dinner in a family atmosphere.","description_fr":"Une maison créole dans le bourg de Grand’Rivière, village de pêcheurs tout au nord, au pied de la montagne Pelée, d’où partent de belles randonnées. Depuis trois générations, la même famille y propose des spécialités de la mer, notamment des accras de titiris (minuscules poissons des petites rivières) et des langoustes grillées, avec un dîner en ambiance familiale.","tags":["Creole"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/tante-arlette","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Type","Payment","Languages spoken","Services","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"kind":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/tante-arlette","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/tante-arlette","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/tante-arlette","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/tante-arlett