se baigner dans les eaux limpides de la plage et profiter d’activités de plage gratuites pour les clients.","tags":["Beachfront"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/ti-payot","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Price range","Type","Payment","Languages spoken","Services"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"kind":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/ti-payot","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/ti-payot","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/ti-payot","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/ti-payot","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/ti-payot","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"services":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/ti-payot","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/ti-payot","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/ti-payot","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"kind":["Restaurant de plage"],"phone":"+596 596 69 07 38","address":"1, Allée des raisiniers, Plage de Grande Anse, 97217 Les Anses-D''Arlet","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Chèques vacances","Espèces"],"website":"https://plongeepassion.com/","services":["Point wifi"],"languages":["Anglais","Espagnol","Français"],"priceRange":"15–23 €"}},{"id":71,"name":"Zanzibar Restaurant","type":"restaurant","lat":14.469536,"lng":-60.87161,"location":"Le Marin","description":"A restaurant in an authentic Creole house, contemporary and romantic, in front of the beach and facing the bay of Le Marin. The menu, renewed regularly, is made from fresh local ingredients with original dishes with local flavours, plus a wine and cocktail list.","description_fr":"Un restaurant dans une demeure créole authentique, contemporaine et romantique, face à la plage et à la baie du Marin. La carte change régulièrement et s’appuie sur des produits locaux bruts et frais, avec des créations originales aux accents locaux, ainsi qu’une carte des vins et des cocktails.","tags":["Fine Dining"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/zanzibar-restaurant","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Price range","Type","Payment","Languages spoken","Services","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"kind":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/zanzibar-restaurant","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/zanzibar-restaurant","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/zanzibar-restaurant","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/zanzibar-restaurant","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/zanzibar-restaurant","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/zanzibar-restaurant","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"services":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/zanzibar-restaurant","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/zanzibar-restaurant","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/zanzibar-restaurant","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}}