n_fr":"Une villa au François qui offre un large éventail de massages selon les besoins (détente, douleurs, tensions, stress). On peut aussi la louer en entier pour des événements privés — pool day, mariage, enterrement de vie de jeune fille — avec piscine, massages, cocktails maison et musique.","tags":["Wellness"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/bien-etre/zenergie","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/bien-etre/zenergie","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/bien-etre/zenergie","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/bien-etre/zenergie","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/bien-etre/zenergie","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/bien-etre/zenergie","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/bien-etre/zenergie","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 30 56 56","address":"Cap Est Pointe Jacob, 97240 Le François","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces","Virement bancaire"],"website":"https://www.zenergie-martinique.com/","languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"70 €"},"opening_periods":[{"day":0,"opens":480,"closes":1080},{"day":1,"opens":480,"closes":1080},{"day":2,"opens":480,"closes":1080},{"day":3,"opens":480,"closes":1080},{"day":4,"opens":480,"closes":1080},{"day":5,"opens":480,"closes":1080},{"day":6,"opens":480,"closes":1080}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/bien-etre/zenergie","hours_updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:31:51.274807+00:00"},{"id":85,"name":"Atelier Culinaire De Tatie Maryse","type":"activity","lat":14.66084,"lng":-61.036946,"location":"Saint-Joseph","description":"Cooking workshops in Saint-Joseph that celebrate Caribbean ingredients in typical and creative recipes while staying true to Creole taste. The approach favours fresh, seasonal produce and gourmet recipes, both in the workshops and in the team''s recipe blog.","description_fr":"Des ateliers de cuisine à Saint-Joseph qui mettent en valeur les produits des Antilles dans des recettes typiques et créatives, fidèles au goût créole. La démarche privilégie les produits frais et de saison, aussi bien dans les ateliers que dans les recettes du blog.","tags":["Cooking Class"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/atelier-culinaire-de-tatie-maryse","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Price range"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/atelier-culinaire-de-tatie-maryse","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/atelier-culinaire-de-tatie-maryse","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97212 Saint-Joseph","priceRange":"47 €"}},{"id":86,"name":"Batterie Sainte Catherine","type":"activity","lat":14.6123175,"lng":-61.098862,"location":"Schœlcher","description":"A small piece of the island''s military history in the Madiana district of Schœlcher: an 18th-century battery that stood against English attacks and helped protect Fort Saint-Louis. Today it is a pleasant spot with views of the coast and a path to the lively town of Schœlcher.","description_fr":"À Schœlcher, dans le quartier de Madiana, la batterie Sainte-Catherine rappelle l’histoire militaire de l’île : construite au XVIIIe siècle, elle a défendu la côte contre les navires anglais et protégé le fort Saint-Louis. Le site, calme aujourd’hui, offre un point de vue sur le littoral et un sentier jusqu’au bourg.","tags":["Heritage","History"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/batterie-sainte-catherine","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/batterie-sainte-catherine","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Quartier Madiana, 97233 Schoelcher"}},{"id":87,"name":"Bèlè An Wout","type":"activity","lat":14.6107752,"lng":-61.066606,"location":"Fort-de-France","description":"An association founded in 2019 to promote Martinican culture and the traditional bèlè music and dance. Newcomers can join at any time of year, and drum-led introductory workshops are open to solo visitors or groups of friends.","description_fr":"Une association créée en 2019 pour faire vivre la culture martiniquaise et la musique et la danse traditionnelles bèlè. On peut la rejoindre à tout moment de l’année, et des stages d’initiation au son du tambour sont ouverts aux visiteurs seuls ou entre amis.","tags":["Culture","Dance"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/bele-wout","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/bele-wout","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/bele-wout","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/bele-wout","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/bele-wout","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/bele-wout","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/bele-wout","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/bele-wout","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 35 98 66","address":"26, rue théodore baude Crozanville, 97200 Fort-De-France","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces","Virement bancaire"],"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/beleanwout","instagram":"https://instagram.com/bele_an_wout","languages":["Anglais","Espagnol","Français"],"priceRange":"20–600 €"},"opening_periods":[{"day":0,"opens":540,"closes":840},{"day":3,"opens":840,"closes":1080},{"day":4,"opens":1080,"closes":1320},{"day":5,"opens":840,"closes":1080},{"day":6,"opens":540,"closes":1080}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/bele-wout","hours_updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:31:51.823634+00:00"},{"id":88,"name":"Caminagua Step Paddle","type":"activity","lat":14.502324,"lng":-61.084027,"location":"Les Anses-d’Arlet","description":"A pedal-powered stand-up paddle rental on Grande Anse beach in Les Anses-d''Arlet. You stand on the board, steer with handlebars and pedal across clear water where turtles, rays and other marine life can be seen.","description_fr":"Une location de step paddle à pédales sur la plage de Grande Anse, aux Anses-d’Arlet. On reste debout sur la planche, on dirige avec un guidon et on pédale sur une eau translucide où l’on peut apercevoir tortues, raies et autre faune marine.","tags":["Paddle"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/caminagua-step-paddle","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Social media","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/caminagua-step-paddle","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/caminagua-step-paddle","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/caminagua-step-paddle","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/caminagua-step-paddle","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/caminagua-step-paddle","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 94 60 70","address":"plage de Grande Anse Près du ponton, 97217 Les Anses-D''Arlet","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Virement bancaire"],"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/search/top","languages":["Anglais","Espagnol","Français"]},"opening_periods":[{"day":0,"opens":600,"closes":1020},{"day":3,"opens":600,"closes":1020},{"day":4,"opens":600,"closes":1020},{"day":5,"opens":600,"closes":1020},{"day":6,"opens":600,"closes":1020}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/caminagua-step-paddle","hours_updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:31:52.098652+00:00"},{"id":89,"name":"Centre De Decouverte Des Sciences De La Terre","type":"activity","lat":14.754911,"lng":-61.178967,"location":"Saint-Pierre","description":"A memorial and science centre at the foot of Montagne Pelée about the 1902 eruption, major natural risks and scientific culture. It has an earthquake-resistant building, a themed garden, a fresh view across Martinique, interactive exhibitions, films and an exhibition from the French natural history museum on how the mountain formed and on the eruption of 8 May 1902.","description_fr":"Un site de mémoire et de culture scientifique au pied de la montagne Pelée, consacré à l’éruption de 1902 et à la prévention des risques majeurs. Dans un bâtiment parasismique : jardin à thèmes, panorama sur l’île, expositions interactives, films, et une exposition du Muséum national d’histoire naturelle racontant comment la montagne s’est formée, puis l’éruption du 8 mai 1902.","tags":["Museum","Culture"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/centre-de-decouverte-des-sciences-de-la-terre","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Services"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/centre-de-decouverte-des-sciences-de-la-terre","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/centre-de-decouverte-des-sciences-de-la-terre","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/centre-de-decouverte-des-sciences-de-la-terre","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"services":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/centre-de-decouverte-des-sciences-de-la-terre","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/centre-de-decouverte-des-sciences-de-la-terre","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/centre-de-decouverte-des-sciences-de-la-terre","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 52 82 42","address":"Habitation Perinelle, Saint Pierre, 97250 Saint-Pierre","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Chèques bancaires et postaux","Espèces"],"services":["Boutique"],"languages":["Français"],"priceRange":"3–5 €"}},{"id":90,"name":"Centre D’interprétation Du Patrimoine Paul Gauguin","type":"activity","lat":14.72853017,"lng":-61.1798181,"location":"Le Carbet","description":"A modernised centre at Anse Turin with an interactive multimedia space about Paul Gauguin and his 1887 stay in Le Carbet. The Martinique experience was a turning point for the artist and marked his painting, and the works that followed bear witness to the island''s heritage and society in the late 19th century.","description_fr":"Un centre d’interprétation modernisé à l’Anse Turin, avec un espace multimédia interactif consacré à Paul Gauguin et à son séjour au Carbet en 1887. Cette expérience martiniquaise a été un tournant pour l’artiste et a marqué sa peinture ; ses œuvres de cette période témoignent du patrimoine et de la société de la fin du XIXe siècle.","tags":["Museum","Culture"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/centre-dinterpretation-du-patrimoine-paul-gauguin","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Services"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/centre-dinterpretation-du-patrimoine-paul-gauguin","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/centre-dinterpretation-du-patrimoine-paul-gauguin","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/centre-dinterpretation-du-patrimoine-paul-gauguin","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/centre-dinterpretation-du-patrimoine-paul-gauguin","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/centre-dinterpretation-du-patrimoine-paul-gauguin","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"services":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/centre-dinterpretation-du-patrimoine-paul-gauguin","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/centre-dinterpretation-du-patrimoine-paul-gauguin","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/centre-dinterpretation-du-patrimoine-paul-gauguin","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 51 53 13","address":"Anse Turin, 97221 Le Carbet","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Chèques bancaires et postaux","Espèces","Virement bancaire"],"website":"https://www.paulgauguinmartinique.fr/","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/paulgauguinmartinique","services":["Boutique"],"languages":["Anglais","Espagnol","Français"],"priceRange":"7–10 €"}},{"id":91,"name":"Chocolaterie Les Freres Lauzea","type":"activity","lat":14.6228866,"lng":-60.989974,"location":"Le Lamentin","description":"A chocolate maker in Le Lamentin, run by two brothers since 2004, making chocolates with ganaches of tropical fruit such as guava, passion fruit and coconut, and garden spices such as basil, chilli and mint. They also make fruit jellies, with and without alcohol.","description_fr":"Une chocolaterie du Lamentin, fondée par deux frères en 2004. Ses ganaches marient fruits tropicaux (goyave, maracudja, noix de coco) et épices ou herbes du jardin (basilic, piment, menthe) ; la maison fait aussi des pâtes de fruit, avec ou sans alcool.","tags":["Chocolate","Tasting"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/chocolaterie-les-freres-lauzea","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/chocolaterie-les-freres-lauzea","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/chocolaterie-les-freres-lauzea","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/chocolaterie-les-freres-lauzea","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/chocolaterie-les-freres-lauzea","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/chocolaterie-les-freres-lauzea","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/chocolaterie-les-freres-lauzea","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/chocolaterie-les-freres-lauzea","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 50 50 18","address":"Immeuble Bois Carré, Quartier Mangot Vulcin, 97232 Le Lamentin","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"website":"https://www.frereslauzea.fr/","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/pg/FreresLauzea/photos","languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"8,25 €"},"opening_periods":[{"day":0,"opens":540,"closes":840},{"day":0,"opens":900,"closes":1080},{"day":1,"opens":540,"closes":840},{"day":1,"opens":900,"closes":1080},{"day":2,"opens":540,"closes":840},{"day":2,"opens":900,"closes":1080},{"day":3,"opens":540,"closes":840},{"day":3,"opens":900,"closes":1080},{"day":4,"opens":540,"closes":840},{"day":4,"opens":900,"closes":1080},{"day":5,"opens":540,"closes":840},{"day":5,"opens":900,"closes":1080},{"day":6,"opens":540,"closes":840},{"day":6,"opens":900,"closes":1080}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/chocolaterie-les-freres-lauzea","hours_updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:31:52.701231+00:00"},{"id":92,"name":"Christophe Mert","type":"activity","lat":14.4599902,"lng":-60.909611,"location":"Rivière-Pilote","description":"The studio of Christophe Mert, an artist from Rivière-Pilote whose paintings draw on his multicultural roots and Caribbean culture, with references to Africa and Amerindian traces and a symbolic use of colour. Visits are arranged directly with the artist.","description_fr":"L’atelier de l’artiste Christophe Mert, de Rivière-Pilote : une peinture nourrie de ses origines pluriculturelles et de la culture antillaise, avec des clins d’œil à l’Afrique et aux vestiges amérindiens, et des couleurs chargées de sens. On le contacte directement pour visiter.","tags":["Art","Culture"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/christophe-mert","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/christophe-mert","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/christophe-mert","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/christophe-mert","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/christophe-mert","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Quartier Anse Figuier, 97211 Riviere-Pilote","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Chèques bancaires et postaux","Espèces","Virement bancaire"],"languages":["Français"],"priceRange":"52 €"}},{"id":93,"name":"Distillerie A1710","type":"activity","lat":14.5873576,"lng":-60.8702185,"location":"Le François","description":"Described as Martinique''s youngest and most innovative distillery, in Le François. The visit follows sugar cane from the field to the tasting of its rums, through the historic estate and the old sugar mill, with a working distillery and copper stills.","description_fr":"Présentée comme la plus jeune et la plus innovante distillerie de la Martinique, au François. La visite suit la canne à sucre du champ jusqu’à la dégustation de ses rhums, entre l’habitation historique, l’ancienne sucrerie et une distillerie en activité avec ses alambics en cuivre.","tags":["Rum Tasting","History","Garden"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-a1710","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-a1710","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-a1710","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-a1710","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-a1710","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-a1710","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-a1710","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-a1710","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-a1710","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 08 26 30","address":"Habitation du Simon, 97240 Le François","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"website":"https://www.rhum-a1710.com/","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/RhumA1710","instagram":"https://instagram.com/rhum_a1710","languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"25 €"}},{"id":94,"name":"Distillerie Depaz","type":"activity","lat":14.7549809,"lng":-61.151971,"location":"Saint-Pierre","description":"A rum estate at the foot of Montagne Pelée, covering 80 hectares of volcanic land between sea and mountain. The estate dates from 1635 and was destroyed in the 1902 eruption that levelled Saint-Pierre; it was rebuilt by Victor Depaz, the only member of the family to survive, and became a distillery.","description_fr":"Un domaine rhumier qui s’étire sur 80 hectares, sur les pentes volcaniques de la montagne Pelée, à la fois face à la mer et à la montagne. Construit en 1635, il a été détruit par l’éruption de 1902, qui a rasé Saint-Pierre ; Victor Depaz, seul survivant de la famille, a décidé de le relever pour en faire une distillerie.","tags":["Rum Tasting","History","Garden"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-depaz","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-chateau-depaz-habitation-la-montagne","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme — related listing","fields":["Name","Description","Social media","Services"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-depaz","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-depaz","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-depaz","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-depaz","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-chateau-depaz-habitation-la-montagne","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"services":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-chateau-depaz-habitation-la-montagne","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-chateau-depaz-habitation-la-montagne","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-depaz","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-depaz","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 78 13 14","address":"Habitation la Montagne, 97250 Saint-Pierre","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Chèques bancaires et postaux"],"website":"https://www.depaz.fr/","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/rhumdepaz","services":["Boutique"],"instagram":"https://instagram.com/rhum_depaz","languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"5–7 €"},"opening_periods":[{"day":1,"opens":540,"closes":960},{"day":2,"opens":540,"closes":960},{"day":3,"opens":540,"closes":960},{"day":4,"opens":540,"closes":960},{"day":5,"opens":540,"closes":960},{"day":6,"opens":600,"closes":1020}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-depaz","hours_updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:31:53.287043+00:00"},{"id":95,"name":"Distillerie Hardy","type":"activity","lat":14.7622462,"lng":-60.912127,"location":"La Trinité","description":"A family-run distillery on the Caravelle peninsula, in the same family since the 19th century and a good example of Martinique''s rum history. It keeps a discreet, authentic charm, and a small shop next to the factory sells local products that can be tasted on a rooftop with a sea view.","description_fr":"Sur la presqu’île de la Caravelle, une distillerie familiale depuis le XIXe siècle, bel exemple de l’histoire du rhum martiniquais. Elle garde un charme sobre et authentique ; la petite boutique attenante vend des produits du cru, à déguster sur un toit-terrasse tourné vers la mer.","tags":["Rum Tasting","History","Garden"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-hardy","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-hardy","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-hardy","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-hardy","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-hardy","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-hardy","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-hardy","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 58 20 82","address":"Tartane, 97220 La Trinité","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"website":"https://www.reference-rhum.com/G-Hardy-54","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/RhumHardy","languages":["Anglais","Français"]}},{"id":96,"name":"Distillerie Maison La Mauny","type":"activity","lat":14.50653758,"lng":-60.9072116,"location":"Rivière-Pilote","description":"A rum estate in Rivière-Pilote, established in 1749, where a small train tours the grounds with stories about the site before a guide leads you into the working distillery. The visit continues in the ageing cellar, where blending and the ageing of old rums are explained, and ends with a tasting at the Cabane à Rhum.","description_fr":"Un domaine rhumier de Rivière-Pilote, installé depuis 1749, où un petit train parcourt les terres en racontant l’histoire du lieu avant qu’un guide ne vous conduise dans la distillerie en activité. La visite se poursuit au chai, pour comprendre l’assemblage et le vieillissement des rhums vieux, et se termine par une dégustation à la Cabane à Rhum.","tags":["Rum Tasting","History","Garden"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-maison-la-mauny","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-maison-la-mauny","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-maison-la-mauny","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-maison-la-mauny","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-maison-la-mauny","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-maison-la-mauny","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 62 18 79","address":"Domaine de la Mauny, 97211 Riviere-Pilote","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"website":"https://www.maisonlamauny.com/","languages":["Anglais","Français"]}},{"id":97,"name":"Distillerie Neisson","type":"activity","lat":14.7009068,"lng":-61.181036,"location":"Le Carbet","description":"A small, independent family distillery at the entrance to Le Carbet, founded in 1932 by two brothers. It is known for white rum and in 2016 produced the world''s first organic AOC white rum; in 2018 it received the state label Entreprise du Patrimoine Vivant. It offers two types of visit experience.","description_fr":"Une petite distillerie familiale et indépendante à l’entrée du Carbet, fondée en 1932 par deux frères. Elle est réputée pour ses rhums blancs et a élaboré en 2016 le premier rhum blanc bio AOC au monde ; en 2018, elle a reçu le label d’État Entreprise du patrimoine vivant. Deux types de visites sont proposés.","tags":["Rum Tasting","History","Garden"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-neisson","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-neisson","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-neisson","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-neisson","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-neisson","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-neisson","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-neisson","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-neisson","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 78 03 70","address":"Le Coin, Grand Anse, 97221 Le Carbet","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"website":"https://neisson.com/","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/rhumneissonofficiel","instagram":"https://instagram.com/rhums_neisson","languages":["Anglais","Français"]}},{"id":98,"name":"Distillerie St James","type":"activity","lat":14.778071,"lng":-61.012205,"location":"Sainte-Marie","description":"The oldest of Martinique''s rum brands, whose distillery in Sainte-Marie is worth a visit. Saint-James made the first square bottle in 1883 and, in the 1970s, began rum tourism on the island; the 1872 wooden colonial house holds the Rum Museum, with a paddle wheel from 1860 and cane mills in the gardens.","description_fr":"La plus ancienne des marques de rhum martiniquaises, dont la distillerie de Sainte-Marie vaut la visite. Saint-James a créé la première bouteille carrée en 1883 et lancé le tourisme du rhum sur l’île dans les années 1970 ; la maison coloniale en bois de 1872 abrite le Musée du Rhum, avec une roue à aubes de 1860 et des moulins à canne dans les jardins.","tags":["Rum Tasting","History","Garden"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-st-james","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-st-james","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-st-james","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-st-james","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-st-james","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-st-james","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-st-james","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 69 30 02","address":"Usine de Sainte Marie, 97230 Sainte-Marie","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Chèques vacances","Espèces","Tickets restaurant"],"website":"https://saintjames-rum.com/","instagram":"https://instagram.com/distillerie_saintjames_mq","languages":["Anglais","Français"]},"opening_periods":[{"day":0,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":1,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":2,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":3,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":4,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":5,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":6,"opens":540,"closes":1020}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-st-james","hours_updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:31:53.988987+00:00"},{"id":99,"name":"Distillerie Trois Rivieres","type":"activity","lat":14.4798345,"lng":-60.9636464,"location":"Sainte-Luce","description":"The former distillery in Sainte-Luce on the southern beaches road, recognisable by its windmill; rum production moved elsewhere in 2004. Guides explain the traditional methods for Trois-Rivières agricultural rum, from cutting the cane to ageing, with an immersive show in the cellar, a large painted fresco along the path and craft shops.","description_fr":"Sur la route des plages du Sud, à Sainte-Luce, cette ancienne distillerie se repère à son moulin à vent ; la production a quitté le site en 2004. Les guides y décrivent les méthodes traditionnelles des rhums agricoles Trois Rivières, de la coupe de la canne à leur vieillissement, puis une animation immersive se déroule dans le chai. Une grande fresque au sol borde le sentier, et des boutiques d’artisans jalonnent la promenade.","tags":["Rum Tasting","History","Garden"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-trois-rivieres","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-trois-rivieres","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-trois-rivieres","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-trois-rivieres","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-trois-rivieres","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-trois-rivieres","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 62 51 78","address":"Quartier Trois-Rivières, 97228 Sainte-Luce","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"website":"https://www.troisrivieresrhum.com/fr-fr","languages":["Anglais","Français"]},"opening_periods":[{"day":1,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":2,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":3,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":4,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":5,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":6,"opens":540,"closes":1020}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-trois-rivieres","hours_updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:31:54.263899+00:00"},{"id":100,"name":"Explore Martinique (Tété Dwèt)","type":"activity","lat":14.6033332,"lng":-61.046196,"location":"Fort-de-France","description":"Food-led guided experiences introducing Martinican culture and the centre of the capital through its flavours, for curious and food-loving visitors.","description_fr":"Des visites guidées autour de la cuisine pour découvrir la culture martiniquaise et le centre de la capitale par les saveurs, pensées pour les curieux et les gourmands.","tags":["Tasting","Local Produce"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/explore-martinique-tete-dwet","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Website","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/explore-martinique-tete-dwet","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/explore-martinique-tete-dwet","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/explore-martinique-tete-dwet","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/explore-martinique-tete-dwet","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/explore-martinique-tete-dwet","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/explore-martinique-tete-dwet","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/explore-martinique-tete-dwet","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Batiment 3000, Zone Franche de Dillon, 97224 Fort-De-France","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces","Virement bancaire"],"website":"https://www.tetedwet.com/","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/tetedwet.food","instagram":"https://instagram.com/tetedwet.food","languages":["Anglais","Espagnol","Français"],"priceRange":"10–55 €"}},{"id":101,"name":"Flags","type":"activity","lat":14.7430041,"lng":-61.17598,"location":"Saint-Pierre","description":"A monumental 2013 artwork by Laurent Valère made of five 6 m ''bois lélé'', the small star-branched sticks from a Martinican tree that are used to stir ti-punch. The colours combine the French and Martinican flags.","description_fr":"Une œuvre monumentale de Laurent Valère (2013) composée de cinq bois lélé de 6 m de haut, ces petits bâtons en étoile tirés d’un arbre martiniquais qui servent à mélanger le ti-punch. Ses couleurs associent les drapeaux français et martiniquais.","tags":["Art"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/flags","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Social media","Payment"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/flags","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/flags","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/flags","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/flags","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Rue Victor Hugo, 97250 Saint-Pierre","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php","instagram":"https://instagram.com/peyinordmartinique"}},{"id":102,"name":"Fort Saint Louis","type":"activity","lat":14.6035245,"lng":-61.069714,"location":"Fort-de-France","description":"A 17th-century fortress above Fort-de-France bay and its port, among the best preserved in the Caribbean and built in the Vauban style. Guides lead visitors along the citadel''s paths, with panoramic views and a look at the capital''s history.","description_fr":"Une forteresse du XVIIe siècle qui surplombe la baie et le port de Fort-de-France, l’une des plus belles de la Caraïbe, de style Vauban. Des guides mènent les visiteurs le long des sentiers de la citadelle, avec un panorama d’exception et un éclairage sur l’histoire de la capitale.","tags":["Heritage","History"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/fort-saint-louis","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Website","Social media","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/fort-saint-louis","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/fort-saint-louis","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/fort-saint-louis","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/fort-saint-louis","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/fort-saint-louis","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Bd Chevalier Sainte Marthe, 97200 Fort-De-France","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"website":"https://terresducentremartinique.fr/sites-musees/fort-saint-louis","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/fortsaintlouis","languages":["Anglais"]},"opening_periods":[{"day":2,"opens":540,"closes":720},{"day":2,"opens":840,"closes":900},{"day":3,"opens":540,"closes":720},{"day":3,"opens":840,"closes":900},{"day":4,"opens":540,"closes":720},{"day":4,"opens":840,"closes":900},{"day":5,"opens":540,"closes":720},{"day":5,"opens":840,"closes":960},{"day":6,"opens":540,"closes":720}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/fort-saint-louis","hours_updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:31:54.827782+00:00"},{"id":103,"name":"An Griyav-La","type":"activity","lat":14.6769019,"lng":-60.9452794,"location":"Le Robert","description":"An agri-tourism site in the Moulin à Vent district of Le Robert, covering more than 16 hectares of guava, vegetables, citrus orchards and farm animals, on the remains of a former sugar cane estate. Visitors follow trails along the river, such as the path of forgotten fruits and the flower trail.","description_fr":"Un site agrotouristique du quartier Moulin à Vent, au Robert, sur plus de 16 hectares de goyaviers, cultures maraîchères, vergers d’agrumes et animaux de ferme, sur les vestiges d’une ancienne habitation cannière. Des parcours longent la rivière, comme celui des fruits oubliés et le parcours fleuri.","tags":["Tasting","Local Produce"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/griyav-la","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/griyav-la","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/griyav-la","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/griyav-la","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/griyav-la","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/griyav-la","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/griyav-la","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 65 21 17","address":"Quartier moulin à vent, 97231 Le Robert","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/angriyavla.robert","languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"5–10 €"},"opening_periods":[{"day":0,"opens":540,"closes":720},{"day":0,"opens":840,"closes":1020},{"day":1,"opens":540,"closes":720},{"day":1,"opens":840,"closes":1020},{"day":2,"opens":540,"closes":720},{"day":2,"opens":840,"closes":1020},{"day":3,"opens":540,"closes":720},{"day":3,"opens":840,"closes":1020},{"day":4,"opens":540,"closes":720},{"day":4,"opens":840,"closes":1020},{"day":5,"opens":540,"closes":720},{"day":5,"opens":840,"closes":1020},{"day":6,"opens":540,"closes":720},{"day":6,"opens":840,"closes":1020}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/griyav-la","hours_updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:31:55.10809+00:00"},{"id":104,"name":"Habdaphai","type":"activity","lat":14.4550238,"lng":-60.903451,"location":"Le Marin","description":"The studio of Habdaphaï, a Martinican visual artist who works with masks, totems and symbols and a personal language of marks and signs. Visits start in the centre of Le Marin and lead to his workshop on the heights of Cap Beauchêne; they are free, personalised and arranged in advance.","description_fr":"L’atelier d’Habdaphaï, plasticien martiniquais qui travaille les masques, les totems et les symboles dans un langage personnel de traces et de signes. Les visites partent du centre du Marin vers son atelier, sur les hauteurs du Cap Beauchêne ; elles sont gratuites, personnalisées et à organiser à l’avance.","tags":["Art","Culture"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habdaphai","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habdaphai","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habdaphai","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habdaphai","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habdaphai","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habdaphai","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habdaphai","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 48 88 62","address":"Port de Plaisance, Bassin Tortue, 97290 Le Marin","payment":["Chèques bancaires et postaux","Espèces","Virement bancaire"],"website":"https://habdaphai-art-performance.business.site/","languages":["Anglais","Espagnol","Français"],"priceRange":"80 €"}},{"id":105,"name":"Habitation La Salle","type":"activity","lat":14.641528,"lng":-61.024174,"location":"Sainte-Marie","description":"A former 17th-century sugar mill in Sainte-Marie, near the Saint-James estate, now a place of exhibitions and memory with the historic route of sugar cane up to the early distillery. It has a tropical garden and a shop selling the house''s small-batch rum cuvées, hand-bottled and waxed.","description_fr":"Une ancienne sucrerie du XVIIe siècle à Sainte-Marie, près de l’habitation Saint-James, devenue lieu d’expositions et de mémoire, qui retrace le parcours historique de la canne jusqu’aux premiers rhums. On y trouve un jardin tropical et une boutique de cuvées La Salle en quantité confidentielle, embouteillées et cirées à la main.","tags":["Heritage","History"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habitation-la-salle","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Services","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":false,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habitation-la-salle","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habitation-la-salle","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habitation-la-salle","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habitation-la-salle","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"services":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habitation-la-salle","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habitation-la-salle","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habitation-la-salle","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habitation-la-salle","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 62 50 74","address":"RD24, Case Jules, 97230 Sainte-Marie","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/habitationlasalle","services":["Boutique","Espace jeux"],"instagram":"https://instagram.com/habitation_la_salle","languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"5 €"},"opening_periods":[{"day":0,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":1,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":2,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":3,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":4,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":5,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":6,"opens":540,"closes":1020}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habitation-la-salle","hours_updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:31:55.529486+00:00"},{"id":106,"name":"Habitation Saint-Etienne","type":"activity","lat":14.6899196,"lng":-61.014405,"location":"Gros-Morne","description":"A listed estate (inscribed as a historic monument in 2006) crossed by the Lézarde river between Saint-Joseph and Gros-Morne. Its former Maugée sugar lands once covered more than 400 hectares; today visitors tour a garden with 180 rare tree species, labelled a Jardin Remarquable in 2015, and see the bottling line.","description_fr":"Une habitation inscrite aux monuments historiques en 2006, au bord de la Lézarde, entre Saint-Joseph et Gros-Morne. Elle occupe les terres de l’ancienne sucrerie de La Maugée, qui couvraient plus de 400 hectares au début du XIXe siècle. La visite mène dans un jardin de 180 espèces d’arbres rares, labellisé Jardin remarquable en 2015, puis à la chaîne d’embouteillage.","tags":["Rum Tasting","History","Garden"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habitation-saint-etienne","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/jardin-remarquable-de-lhabitation-saint-etienne","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme — related listing","fields":["Name","Description","Price range","Services","Accessibility","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habitation-saint-etienne","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habitation-saint-etienne","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habitation-saint-etienne","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habitation-saint-etienne","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habitation-saint-etienne","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"services":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/jardin-remarquable-de-lhabitation-saint-etienne","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habitation-saint-etienne","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habitation-saint-etienne","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/jardin-remarquable-de-lhabitation-saint-etienne","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"accessibility":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/jardin-remarquable-de-lhabitation-saint-etienne","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 57 49 32","address":"Habitation Saint-Etienne, 97213 Gros-Morne","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Chèques bancaires et postaux"],"website":"https://www.rhum-hse.com/","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/RhumHSE","services":["Boutique","Point wifi"],"instagram":"https://instagram.com/hserhum","languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"1 €","accessibility":"Déficience moteur"},"opening_periods":[{"day":0,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":1,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":2,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":3,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":4,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":5,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":6,"opens":540,"closes":1020}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/jardin-remarquable-de-lhabitation-saint-etienne","hours_updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:31:55.818922+00:00"},{"id":107,"name":"Ice I Bon","type":"activity","lat":14.6084838,"lng":-61.0467191,"location":"Fort-de-France","description":"An artisan ice-cream shop in Fort-de-France making ice creams and fresh seasonal fruit sorbets, plus sweet and savoury crêpes and sundaes.","description_fr":"Un glacier artisanal de Fort-de-France qui prépare des glaces et des sorbets aux fruits de saison, ainsi que des crêpes sucrées ou salées et des coupes glacées.","tags":["Ice Cream"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/ice-i-bon","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/ice-i-bon","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/ice-i-bon","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/ice-i-bon","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/ice-i-bon","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/ice-i-bon","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/ice-i-bon","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"570 Avenue Victor Coridun, 97200 Fort-De-France","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/people/Ice-i-bon/61555938872429","instagram":"https://instagram.com/iceibon","languages":["Anglais","Espagnol","Français"],"priceRange":"3–10 €"}},{"id":108,"name":"Idyllik Punch","type":"activity","lat":14.5783683,"lng":-60.980653,"location":"Ducos","description":"A Martinican craft rum punch created in the hills of Le Morne-Rouge from a revisited family recipe and launched in 2019, blending agricultural rums, local fruit juices and a touch of vanilla.","description_fr":"Un punch artisanal martiniquais né sur les hauteurs du Morne-Rouge, à partir d’une recette familiale revisitée et lancé en 2019, qui associe rhums agricoles, jus de fruits locaux et une touche de vanille.","tags":["Tasting","Local Produce"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/idyllik-punch","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/idyllik-punch","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/idyllik-punch","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/idyllik-punch","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/idyllik-punch","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/idyllik-punch","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/idyllik-punch","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Quartier Fond Panier, 97224 Ducos","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces","Virement bancaire"],"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/Idyllikpunch","instagram":"https://instagram.com/idyllikpunch","languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"4–29,90 €"}},{"id":109,"name":"La Conserverie Creole","type":"activity","lat":14.7747354,"lng":-60.9867354,"location":"Sainte-Marie","description":"A producer of Caribbean-flavoured preserves in jars, with gift ideas and recipe ideas, made without additives or preservatives. It also offers a caterer and private-chef service for private or professional events anywhere on the island.","description_fr":"Un producteur de conserves aux saveurs de la Caraïbe, sans additif ni conservateur, avec des idées de cadeaux et de recettes. La maison propose aussi un service de traiteur et de chef à domicile pour des événements privés ou professionnels partout en Martinique.","tags":["Tasting","Local Produce"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/la-conserverie-creole","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/la-conserverie-creole","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/la-conserverie-creole","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/la-conserverie-creole","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/la-conserverie-creole","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/la-conserverie-creole","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/la-conserverie-creole","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 08 89 88","address":"Zone Artisanale Belle Etoile , Impasse Himalia, 97230 Sainte-Marie","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"website":"https://laconserveriecreole.com/","instagram":"https://instagram.com/laconserveriecreole","languages":["Anglais","Français"]}},{"id":110,"name":"La Fontaine Et La Rue Levassor","type":"activity","lat":14.749634,"lng":-61.1750952,"location":"Saint-Pierre","description":"A fountain, cobbles, gutters, wall remains and staircases in Saint-Pierre that help visitors imagine the two-storey terraced houses with gardens of the new residential district built from the 18th century.","description_fr":"Une fontaine, des pavés, des caniveaux, des pans de murs et des escaliers à Saint-Pierre, qui aident à imaginer les maisons mitoyennes à deux étages avec jardin du quartier résidentiel construit à partir du XVIIIe siècle.","tags":["Heritage"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/la-fontaine-et-la-rue-levassor","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Social media","Payment"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/la-fontaine-et-la-rue-levassor","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/la-fontaine-et-la-rue-levassor","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/la-fontaine-et-la-rue-levassor","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/la-fontaine-et-la-rue-levassor","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Rue Levassor, 97250 Saint-Pierre","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php","instagram":"https://instagram.com/saintpierre_art_histoire"}},{"id":111,"name":"La Poudière Trouvaillant","type":"activity","lat":14.74622051,"lng":-61.1718819,"location":"Saint-Pierre","description":"A fine example of a general powder magazine in Saint-Pierre: a vast excavated building that kept gunpowder for the town''s fortifications safe from damp and bombardment. Its vault, ventilation baffles and double door reflect the improved defences built at the end of the English occupation in 1816.","description_fr":"À Saint-Pierre, une poudrière générale très bien conservée : un grand bâtiment enterré où l’on gardait la poudre des fortifications au sec, à l’écart des bombardements. Sa voûte, ses aérations en chicane et sa porte double datent du renforcement des défenses, lorsque les Anglais ont quitté l’île en 1816.","tags":["Heritage"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/la-poudiere-trouvaillant","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Social media","Payment"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/la-poudiere-trouvaillant","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/la-poudiere-trouvaillant","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/la-poudiere-trouvaillant","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/la-poudiere-trouvaillant","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Allée de la Poudrière, 97250 Saint-Pierre","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php","instagram":"https://instagram.com/peyinordmartinique"}},{"id":112,"name":"La Tombe De La Mère Onésime","type":"activity","lat":14.75225893,"lng":-61.1746713,"location":"Saint-Pierre","description":"The tomb of Pauline Lefebvre in Saint-Pierre, a sister devoted to girls'' education in Martinique and the first woman in the Antilles awarded the Légion d''honneur, for her devotion during the 1875 yellow fever epidemic.","description_fr":"À Saint-Pierre, la sépulture de Pauline Lefebvre, religieuse dévouée à l’éducation des jeunes Martiniquaises et première femme des Antilles à recevoir la Légion d’honneur, pour son dévouement pendant l’épidémie de fièvre jaune de 1875.","tags":["Heritage"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/la-tombe-de-la-mere-onesime","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Social media","Payment"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/la-tombe-de-la-mere-onesime","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/la-tombe-de-la-mere-onesime","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/la-tombe-de-la-mere-onesime","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/la-tombe-de-la-mere-onesime","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Quartier Pecoul, 97250 Saint-Pierre","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php","instagram":"https://instagram.com/peyinordmartinique"}},{"id":113,"name":"Le Marché Couvert","type":"activity","lat":14.74193669,"lng":-61.1763756,"location":"Saint-Pierre","description":"The covered market on Place Bertin in Saint-Pierre, built after the 1923 reconstruction programme. Before 1902 the square was an open esplanade for goods from ships and local growers; the market follows the airy, bright metal architecture of Baltard''s central markets in Paris.","description_fr":"Le marché couvert de la place Bertin, à Saint-Pierre, construit après le programme de reconstruction de 1923. Avant 1902, la place était une vaste esplanade où arrivaient à ciel ouvert les marchandises des bateaux et des exploitants ; le marché s’inspire de l’architecture métallique, aérée et lumineuse, des halles de Baltard à Paris.","tags":["Heritage","History"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-marche-couvert","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Social media","Payment","Languages spoken","Services","Accessibility"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-marche-couvert","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-marche-couvert","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-marche-couvert","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-marche-couvert","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"services":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-marche-couvert","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-marche-couvert","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-marche-couvert","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"accessibility":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-marche-couvert","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 17 64 34","address":"Rue Bouillé, 97250 Saint-Pierre","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php","services":["Boutique","Point wifi"],"instagram":"https://instagram.com/peyinordmartinique","languages":["Anglais","Français"],"accessibility":"Déficience moteur"}},{"id":114,"name":"Le Monde Des Epices / Bénédicte Chocolats","type":"activity","lat":14.5972224,"lng":-60.994398,"location":"Le Lamentin","description":"A shop in Le Lamentin selling spices from Martinique and around the world, freshly roasted 100% Arabica coffee and exotic teas, local and artisan products such as jams, condiments, candied fruit and syrups, a selection of Martinican rums, and its speciality, rum sweets. It also houses the workshop of Bénédicte Chocolats.","description_fr":"Une boutique du Lamentin d’épices de Martinique et du monde entier, avec café 100 % arabica torréfié sur place, thés exotiques, produits locaux et artisanaux (confitures, condiments, fruits confits, sirops), une sélection de rhums martiniquais et sa spécialité, les bonbons au rhum. L’atelier de Bénédicte Chocolats s’y trouve aussi.","tags":["Tasting","Chocolate"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-monde-des-epices-benedicte-chocolats","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-monde-des-epices-benedicte-chocolats","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-monde-des-epices-benedicte-chocolats","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-monde-des-epices-benedicte-chocolats","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-monde-des-epices-benedicte-chocolats","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-monde-des-epices-benedicte-chocolats","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-monde-des-epices-benedicte-chocolats","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"4 ZAC Lareinty, 97232 Le Lamentin","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/mondedesepices","instagram":"https://instagram.com/mondedesepicesmartinique","languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"2,10–390 €"}},{"id":115,"name":"Le Petit Train De Belfort","type":"activity","lat":14.6502749,"lng":-60.996664,"location":"Le Lamentin","description":"A small-train visit of a banana-growing estate in the Le Lamentin countryside, introducing 30 years of banana know-how. The train covers the whole estate and works in the rain; morning departures run from Tuesday to Saturday, and groups can book other days.","description_fr":"Une visite en petit train d’une exploitation bananière, nichée dans la campagne du Lamentin, pour découvrir trente ans de savoir-faire autour de la banane. Le train parcourt toute l’exploitation et permet de visiter même sous la pluie ; les départs ont lieu le matin du mardi au samedi, et les groupes peuvent réserver d’autres jours.","tags":["Farm Visit","Train"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-petit-train-de-belfort","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Services"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-petit-train-de-belfort","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-petit-train-de-belfort","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-petit-train-de-belfort","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-petit-train-de-belfort","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-petit-train-de-belfort","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"services":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-petit-train-de-belfort","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-petit-train-de-belfort","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-petit-train-de-belfort","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-petit-train-de-belfort","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 25 25 89","address":"Quartier Belfort, 97232 Le Lamentin","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"website":"https://www.visitebelfort.com/","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/visitebelfort","services":["Boutique","Espace jeux"],"instagram":"https://instagram.com/visitebelfort","languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"6–35 €"}},{"id":116,"name":"Le Théâtre","type":"activity","lat":14.74687026,"lng":-61.1760688,"location":"Saint-Pierre","description":"The ruins of the theatre of Saint-Pierre, the island''s cultural capital, which opened in 1786. It was a centre of high society that also welcomed free people of colour, helped bring new musical styles such as the biguine, and staged major Parisian opera, theatre and ballet. Damaged by the 1891 cyclone and restored in 1900, just before the eruption, its remains still keep remarkable acoustics.","description_fr":"Les vestiges du théâtre de Saint-Pierre, capitale culturelle de l’île, ouvert dès 1786. Lieu de sociabilité mondaine, il accueillait aussi les libres de couleur, a favorisé l’émergence de styles musicaux comme la biguine et programmait de grandes pièces d’opéra, de théâtre et de ballet venues de Paris. Endommagé par le cyclone de 1891 puis remis en état en 1900, peu avant l’éruption, il garde dans ses ruines une acoustique remarquable.","tags":["Heritage"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-theatre","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Social media","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-theatre","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-theatre","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-theatre","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-theatre","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-theatre","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Rue Victor Hugo, 97250 Saint-Pierre","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php","instagram":"https://instagram.com/saintpierre_art_histoire","languages":["Anglais","Français"]}},{"id":117,"name":"L''église Du Fort","type":"activity","lat":14.75060409,"lng":-61.1786249,"location":"Saint-Pierre","description":"One of the oldest churches in Saint-Pierre, built in 1678 to replace the first church, which became the fort cemetery''s chapel. Dedicated to Saint Peter, patron of the town, it was run by the Jesuits until 1763. A Baroque church on a cross plan, it was enlarged three years before the 1902 eruption, and thick fragments of walls, columns and statues scattered across the site show the eruption''s destructive power.","description_fr":"À Saint-Pierre, l’église du Fort compte parmi les plus anciennes de la ville : bâtie en 1678, elle succède à la première église, transformée en chapelle du cimetière du fort. Placée sous le patronage de saint Pierre, elle fut aux mains des jésuites jusqu’en 1763. Baroque, à plan cruciforme, elle fut agrandie et modernisée trois ans avant 1902 ; les gros morceaux de murs, de colonnes et de statues qui jonchent le site rappellent la violence de l’éruption.","tags":["Heritage"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/leglise-du-fort","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Social media","Payment"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/leglise-du-fort","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/leglise-du-fort","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/leglise-du-fort","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/leglise-du-fort","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Rue de l''Eglise, 97250 Saint-Pierre","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php","instagram":"https://instagram.com/peyinordmartinique"}},{"id":118,"name":"Les Bureaux Du Génie Civil","type":"activity","lat":14.74972738,"lng":-61.1732203,"location":"Saint-Pierre","description":"A site in Saint-Pierre in a fine 18th-century private house, built on the lands of Habitation Levassor, one of the oldest estates in Martinique. It spreads over three terraces on a cliffside with an extraordinary view, with an ingenious hydraulic system carrying water from the fort canal into several basins, and outbuildings including a well-preserved kitchen with an oven.","description_fr":"Un site de Saint-Pierre installé dans une belle maison privée du XVIIIe siècle, élevée sur les terres de l’habitation Levassor, l’une des plus anciennes de la Martinique. Il s’étage sur trois terrasses à flanc de falaise, avec une vue remarquable, un système hydraulique ingénieux qui amène l’eau du canal du fort vers plusieurs bassins, et de nombreuses dépendances, dont une cuisine bien conservée avec four.","tags":["Heritage"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/les-bureaux-du-genie-civil","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Social media","Payment"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/les-bureaux-du-genie-civil","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/les-bureaux-du-genie-civil","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/les-bureaux-du-genie-civil","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/les-bureaux-du-genie-civil","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Rue Levassor, 97250 Saint-Pierre","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php","instagram":"https://instagram.com/peyinordmartinique"}},{"id":119,"name":"Les Rails De La Canne A Sucre","type":"activity","lat":14.7835605,"lng":-60.99788,"location":"Sainte-Marie","description":"A heritage plantation train run by an association of railway enthusiasts, pulled by a diesel locomotive and making a return trip to the Saint-James Rum Museum. The scenic ride crosses sugar cane and banana fields in Sainte-Marie, the island''s cultural cradle.","description_fr":"Un train des plantations lancé par des passionnés de chemin de fer réunis en association. Un locotracteur diesel le tire jusqu’au Musée du Rhum Saint-James et retour. Le parcours, pittoresque, traverse des champs de canne et de banane, au cœur de Sainte-Marie, berceau culturel de la Martinique.","tags":["Train","Heritage"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/les-rails-de-la-canne-sucre","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/les-rails-de-la-canne-sucre","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/les-rails-de-la-canne-sucre","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/les-rails-de-la-canne-sucre","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/les-rails-de-la-canne-sucre","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/les-rails-de-la-canne-sucre","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 63 31 08","address":"Distillerie Saint-James, BP - 37, 97230 Sainte-Marie","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Chèques bancaires et postaux"],"website":"https://www.traindesplantations-rcs.fr/","languages":["Anglais","Français"]}},{"id":120,"name":"Maison Du Cacao Martinique - Valcaco","type":"activity","lat":14.832504,"lng":-61.0549624,"location":"Le Lorrain","description":"The Maison du Cacao in Le Lorrain, the result of ten years'' effort to build a quality cocoa sector in Martinique, promoting the island''s micro-terroirs and know-how. It has a museum, educational workshops, tastings, exhibitions and a shop, and brings together growers, processors and cocoa lovers.","description_fr":"Au Lorrain, une maison dédiée au cacao martiniquais, fruit d’une décennie d’efforts de la filière pour viser l’excellence ; elle met en avant les micro-terroirs et le savoir-faire local. On y trouve une boutique, un musée, des expositions, des dégustations et des ateliers pour apprendre, et le lieu rassemble ceux qui cultivent, transforment ou simplement aiment le cacao.","tags":["Chocolate","Farm Visit"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/maison-du-cacao-martinique-valcaco","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/maison-du-cacao-martinique-valcaco","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/maison-du-cacao-martinique-valcaco","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/maison-du-cacao-martinique-valcaco","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/maison-du-cacao-martinique-valcaco","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"258 route de Macédoine, Le Lorrain","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"7,50–25 €"}},{"id":121,"name":"Mémorial De La Catastrophe De 1902 - Musée Frank A. Perret","type":"activity","lat":14.746877,"lng":-61.17652,"location":"Saint-Pierre","description":"A memorial museum in Saint-Pierre on the 1902 eruption, which ended the glory years of the former colonial city once nicknamed the Little Paris. It recounts the history of the town and its people through that year, seen as the end of one era and the start of another.","description_fr":"Un musée-mémorial de Saint-Pierre consacré à l’éruption de 1902, qui mit fin à l’âge d’or de l’ancienne ville coloniale surnommée le petit Paris. Il raconte l’histoire de la ville et de ses habitants à travers cette année, vécue comme la fin d’une ère et le début d’une autre.","tags":["Museum","Culture"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/memorial-de-la-catastrophe-de-1902-musee-frank-perret","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Services","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/memorial-de-la-catastrophe-de-1902-musee-frank-perret","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/memorial-de-la-catastrophe-de-1902-musee-frank-perret","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/memorial-de-la-catastrophe-de-1902-musee-frank-perret","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/memorial-de-la-catastrophe-de-1902-musee-frank-perret","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"services":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/memorial-de-la-catastrophe-de-1902-musee-frank-perret","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/memorial-de-la-catastrophe-de-1902-musee-frank-perret","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/memorial-de-la-catastrophe-de-1902-musee-frank-perret","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/memorial-de-la-catastrophe-de-1902-musee-frank-perret","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 03 80 86","address":"169 Rue Victor Hugo, 97250 Saint-Pierre","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Chèques bancaires et postaux","Espèces"],"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/memorial1902","services":["Point wifi"],"instagram":"https://instagram.com/memorial1902","languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"6–8 €"},"opening_periods":[{"day":0,"opens":540,"closes":1080},{"day":1,"opens":540,"closes":1080},{"day":2,"opens":540,"closes":1080},{"day":3,"opens":540,"closes":1080},{"day":4,"opens":540,"closes":1080},{"day":5,"opens":540,"closes":1080},{"day":6,"opens":540,"closes":1080}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/memorial-de-la-catastrophe-de-1902-musee-frank-perret","hours_updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:31:58.068497+00:00"},{"id":122,"name":"Musee Du Pere Pinchon","type":"activity","lat":14.641528,"lng":-61.024174,"location":"Fort-de-France","description":"A free natural-history museum in Fort-de-France dedicated to the island''s biodiversity, holding nearly 10,000 pieces from the naturalist collection of Père Pinchon (1913–1980): birds, insects, reptiles, shells and marine species. He was a science teacher and a pioneer in knowing Martinique''s biodiversity.","description_fr":"Un musée gratuit de Fort-de-France consacré à la biodiversité martiniquaise : il conserve environ 10 000 spécimens (oiseaux, insectes, reptiles, coquillages, faune marine) issus de la collection du Père Pinchon, enseignant de sciences naturelles (1913-1980) et pionnier de l’étude de cette biodiversité.","tags":["Museum","Culture"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/musee-du-pere-pinchon","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":false,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/musee-du-pere-pinchon","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/musee-du-pere-pinchon","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/musee-du-pere-pinchon","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 42 12 30","address":"33 Rue du Professeur Raymond Garcin, Route de Didier, 97200 Fort-De-France","languages":["Français"]},"opening_periods":[{"day":1,"opens":480,"closes":1020},{"day":2,"opens":840,"closes":1020},{"day":3,"opens":480,"closes":1020},{"day":4,"opens":480,"closes":1020},{"day":5,"opens":480,"closes":1020},{"day":6,"opens":480,"closes":720}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/musee-du-pere-pinchon","hours_updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:31:58.346358+00:00"},{"id":123,"name":"Place Hurrard","type":"activity","lat":14.634273,"lng":-60.92305,"location":"Le François","description":"An artisan producer of biscuits and cakes in Le François, with products that can be enjoyed in many ways, for example with tea or coffee or as gifts. Tastings of the products can be booked.","description_fr":"Un atelier artisanal de biscuits et de gâteaux au François, dont les produits se dégustent de multiples façons, par exemple avec un thé ou un café, ou s’offrent en cadeau. Des dégustations peuvent être réservées.","tags":["Tasting","Local Produce"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/place-hurrard","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/place-hurrard","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/place-hurrard","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/place-hurrard","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/place-hurrard","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/place-hurrard","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 83 68 97","address":"Chopotte, 97240 Le François","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Chèques bancaires et postaux","Espèces"],"languages":["Français"],"priceRange":"5 €"},"opening_periods":[{"day":1,"opens":420,"closes":900},{"day":2,"opens":420,"closes":900},{"day":3,"opens":420,"closes":900},{"day":4,"opens":420,"closes":900},{"day":5,"opens":420,"closes":900}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/place-hurrard","hours_updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:31:58.61724+00:00"},{"id":124,"name":"Qv Tropicale","type":"activity","lat":14.6183903,"lng":-60.92719,"location":"Le François","description":"A 1h30 visit at the Domaine de Belle Âme in Le François: a walk through tropical orchards, the secrets of how the drinks are made, and a final tasting of sparkling drinks made from local, natural ingredients.","description_fr":"Au Domaine de Belle Âme, au François, une visite d’une heure et demie : promenade parmi les vergers tropicaux, explications sur la fabrication, puis dégustation de boissons gazeuses locales et naturelles.","tags":["Tasting","Local Produce"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/qv-tropicale","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Website","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/qv-tropicale","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/qv-tropicale","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/qv-tropicale","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/qv-tropicale","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/qv-tropicale","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Habitation Grand Fonds, Domaine de Belle-Âme, 97240 Le François","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces","Virement bancaire"],"website":"https://www.qv-tropicale.com/","languages":["Anglais","Espagnol","Français"],"priceRange":"6–12 €"}},{"id":125,"name":"Rhum Braud Et Quenesson","type":"activity","lat":14.4833039,"lng":-60.873783,"location":"Le Marin","description":"A rum heritage address. Ask which tours, gardens, production areas or tastings are available to visitors. Listed address: HABITATION GRAND-FONDS, 97290. Contact: +596 596 74 10 01.","description_fr":"Une adresse du patrimoine du rhum. Renseignez-vous sur les visites, jardins, espaces de production ou dégustations accessibles. Adresse indiquée : HABITATION GRAND-FONDS, 97290. Contact : +596 596 74 10 01.","tags":["Rum Tasting","History","Garden"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/rhum-braud-et-quenesson","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/rhum-braud-et-quenesson","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/rhum-braud-et-quenesson","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/rhum-braud-et-quenesson","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/rhum-braud-et-quenesson","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/rhum-braud-et-quenesson","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/rhum-braud-et-quenesson","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 74 10 01","address":"Habitation Grand-fonds, 97290 Le Marin","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"website":"https://www.braud-quennesson.com/","languages":["Anglais","Espagnol","Français"],"priceRange":"5 €"}},{"id":126,"name":"Rhum Jm - Distillerie De Fonds Preville","type":"activity","lat":14.8573469,"lng":-61.136635,"location":"Macouba","description":"A distillery in the Atlantic north at Fonds Préville in Macouba, in a humid tropical climate with fertile volcanic soil that suits sugar cane. JM rum has been made for centuries using traditional techniques and is described as one of Martinique''s best aged rums.","description_fr":"Une distillerie du nord atlantique, à Fonds Préville (Macouba). Le climat tropical humide et les sols volcaniques fertiles y conviennent très bien à la canne. Le rhum J.M, élaboré depuis des siècles de façon traditionnelle, figure selon la maison parmi les meilleurs rhums vieux de la Martinique.","tags":["Rum Tasting","History","Garden"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/rhum-jm-distillerie-de-fonds-preville","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/rhum-jm-distillerie-de-fonds-preville","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/rhum-jm-distillerie-de-fonds-preville","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/rhum-jm-distillerie-de-fonds-preville","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/rhum-jm-distillerie-de-fonds-preville","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/rhum-jm-distillerie-de-fonds-preville","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/rhum-jm-distillerie-de-fonds-preville","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 78 92 55","address":"Fond Preville, 97218 Macouba","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Chèques bancaires et postaux","Espèces"],"website":"https://www.rhum-jm.com/","languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"30–115 €"}},{"id":127,"name":"Rhums Baie Des Trésors - Habitation Le Galion","type":"activity","lat":14.71973602,"lng":-60.9605909,"location":"La Trinité","description":"A rum house at the main house of Habitation Le Galion in La Trinité, a historic and cultural site, offering an interactive, tasting-led introduction to local products. The main house can be visited by reservation when it is not occupied.","description_fr":"À La Trinité, la rhumerie occupe la maison principale de l’habitation du Galion, un haut lieu d’histoire et de culture. Elle propose de découvrir les produits du terroir de façon interactive, en les goûtant ; la maison elle-même se visite sur réservation, quand elle n’est pas occupée.","tags":["Rum Tasting","History","Garden"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/rhums-baie-des-tresors-habitation-le-galion","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Website","Social media","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/rhums-baie-des-tresors-habitation-le-galion","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/rhums-baie-des-tresors-habitation-le-galion","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/rhums-baie-des-tresors-habitation-le-galion","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/rhums-baie-des-tresors-habitation-le-galion","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/rhums-baie-des-tresors-habitation-le-galion","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/rhums-baie-des-tresors-habitation-le-galion","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Chemin du Galion, 97220 La Trinité","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"website":"https://www.baiedestresors.mq/","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/rhumbaiedestresors","instagram":"https://instagram.com/baiedestresors","languages":["Anglais","Français"]},"opening_periods":[{"day":1,"opens":570,"closes":750},{"day":1,"opens":840,"closes":1020},{"day":2,"opens":570,"closes":750},{"day":2,"opens":840,"closes":1020},{"day":3,"opens":570,"closes":750},{"day":3,"opens":840,"closes":1020},{"day":4,"opens":570,"closes":750},{"day":4,"opens":840,"closes":1020},{"day":5,"opens":570,"closes":750},{"day":5,"opens":840,"closes":1020},{"day":6,"opens":540,"closes":780}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/rhums-baie-des-tresors-habitation-le-galion","hours_updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:31:59.316988+00:00"},{"id":128,"name":"Tropic Reset","type":"activity","lat":14.4989187,"lng":-60.8428213,"location":"Sainte-Luce","description":"An organiser of intimate cultural experiences in eco-lodges, traditional houses and natural settings, to slow down and meet people who keep Caribbean and African cultural heritage alive. Each gathering has at most 15 participants.","description_fr":"Des rencontres à petite échelle (quinze personnes au plus) organisées dans des écolodges, des maisons traditionnelles ou des sites naturels, pour ralentir et échanger avec celles et ceux qui font vivre les héritages culturels afro-caribéens.","tags":["Culture","Dance"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/tropic-reset","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/tropic-reset","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/tropic-reset","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/tropic-reset","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/tropic-reset","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/tropic-reset","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/tropic-reset","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 66 23 23","address":"Quartier Les Coteaux, 97228 Sainte-Luce","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Virement bancaire"],"instagram":"https://instagram.com/tropicreset","languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"90–150 €"},"opening_periods":[{"day":1,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":2,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":3,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":4,"opens":540,"closes":1020},{"day":5,"opens":540,"closes":1020}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/tropic-reset","hours_updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:31:59.60284+00:00"},{"id":129,"name":"Coeur Bouliki","type":"activity","lat":14.6832724,"lng":-61.058876,"location":"Saint-Joseph","description":"A site in Saint-Joseph, the commune with the island''s largest forest area: nearly 1,500 hectares in the north-east, managed and protected by the Office National des Forêts. The Rivière Blanche feeds the site and is a popular bathing spot; it also supplies drinking water to the centre and part of the south of the island.","description_fr":"À Saint-Joseph, une grande zone forestière du nord-est de l’île, qui représente plus du tiers de la commune, soit près de 1 500 hectares gérés et protégés par l’ONF. Le site, nourri par la Rivière Blanche, est apprécié des baigneurs ; la rivière fournit en outre l’eau potable du centre et d’une partie du sud.","tags":["Forest","Nature"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/nature-environnement/coeur-bouliki","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/nature-environnement/coeur-bouliki","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Quartier Durand, 97212 Saint-Joseph"}},{"id":130,"name":"Sentier De La Cascade Couleuvre","type":"activity","lat":14.7979608,"lng":-61.221172,"location":"Le Prêcheur","description":"A discovery trail of about 1,600 m, set up in 2007, following the Couleuvre river on the north-west slopes of Montagne Pelée, with wild and grand scenery. The trail starts at the Anse Couleuvre car park in Le Prêcheur, and the slope steepens as you go upstream.","description_fr":"Au Prêcheur, un sentier de découverte de 1 600 m environ, créé en 2007, qui suit la rivière Couleuvre sur le flanc nord-ouest de la montagne Pelée et traverse des paysages sauvages et grandioses. Le départ se fait au parking de l’Anse Couleuvre ; plus on monte vers l’amont, plus le dénivelé augmente.","tags":["Hiking","Waterfall"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/nature-environnement/sentier-de-la-cascade-couleuvre","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/nature-environnement/sentier-de-la-cascade-couleuvre","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Anse Couleuvre, 97250 Le Precheur"}},{"id":131,"name":"Ka Maché","type":"activity","lat":14.6338686,"lng":-61.06672,"location":"Fort-de-France","description":"A walking group that organises friendly hikes one Sunday a month in different parts of the island, from green summits to coastal paths, led by a federally qualified instructor. Contact the organiser for prices and equipment advice.","description_fr":"Un groupe qui propose des randonnées conviviales, un dimanche par mois, dans différentes régions de l’île : sommets verts ou chemins du littoral. Les sorties sont conduites par un animateur titulaire du brevet fédéral. Pour connaître les prix et l’équipement conseillé, il faut contacter l’organisateur.","tags":["Hiking","Guided Tour"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/ka-mache","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/ka-mache","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/ka-mache","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/ka-mache","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/ka-mache","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/ka-mache","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 83 95 94","address":"Bât Z5 Esc B20 Cité Floréal, 97234 Fort-De-France","payment":["Espèces"],"languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"15 €"}},{"id":132,"name":"Kaiali Excursions","type":"activity","lat":14.8198744,"lng":-61.1128204,"location":"L’Ajoupa-Bouillon","description":"A hiking organiser offering more than 50 hikes from north to south for all levels, from gentle walks to adventures, including overnight bivouacs under the stars.","description_fr":"Un organisateur de randonnées qui propose plus de 50 parcours du nord au sud, adaptés à tous les niveaux, des balades tranquilles aux aventures, avec même des bivouacs d’une nuit sous les étoiles.","tags":["Hiking","Canyoning"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/kaiali-excursions","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/kaiali-excursions","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/kaiali-excursions","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/kaiali-excursions","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/kaiali-excursions","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/kaiali-excursions","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/kaiali-excursions","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/kaiali-excursions","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 77 00 86","address":"2 Cité Grenade, 97216 L''ajoupa-Bouillon","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces","Virement bancaire"],"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php","instagram":"https://instagram.com/kaiali.excursions97","languages":["Français"],"priceRange":"60–450 €"}},{"id":133,"name":"Martinique Best Secret","type":"activity","lat":14.6536177,"lng":-61.031279,"location":"Saint-Joseph","description":"A small-group excursion and transfer service: land tours of the north or south in a minivan of up to 8 passengers, plus airport–hotel transfers every day. Off-the-beaten-track outings take in waterfalls, rivers, forests and a distillery, with medicinal plants and a stop on a black-sand beach, with a private guide.","description_fr":"Un service d’excursions en petit groupe et de transferts : circuits terrestres dans le nord ou le sud en minivan de 8 passagers maximum, et transferts aéroport-hôtel tous les jours. Les balades hors des sentiers battus passent par cascades, rivières, forêts et distillerie, avec les plantes médicinales de l’île et une halte sur une plage de sable noir, avec un guide privé.","tags":["Guided Tour"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/martinique-best-secret","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Opening hours","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/martinique-best-secret","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/martinique-best-secret","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/martinique-best-secret","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/martinique-best-secret","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"hoursText":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/martinique-best-secret","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/martinique-best-secret","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/martinique-best-secret","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/martinique-best-secret","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 16 16 15","address":"173 Gondeau Fond Epingle, Gondeau Fond Epingles, 97212 Saint-Joseph","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces","Virement bancaire"],"website":"https://www.martiniquebestsecret.com/","hoursText":"Lundi : À partir de 00h00, À partir de 00h00\nMardi : À partir de 00h00, À partir de 00h00\nMercredi : À partir de 00h00, À partir de 00h00\nJeudi : À partir de 00h00, À partir de 00h00\nVendredi : À partir de 00h00, À partir de 00h00\nSamedi : À partir de 00h00, À partir de 00h00\nDimanche : À partir de 00h00, À partir de 00h00","instagram":"https://instagram.com/reel/C1PU-sPMmaO","languages":["Allemand","Anglais","Espagnol","Français"],"priceRange":"100 €"}},{"id":134,"name":"Rando/Training/Brunch","type":"activity","lat":14.7052194,"lng":-61.134494,"location":"Le Morne-Vert","description":"A guided experience combining a sporting hike, outdoor training and a local brunch in natural settings, through tropical forest, rivers and sea views. Training sessions cover strength, cardio and mobility and suit all levels.","description_fr":"Une formule encadrée qui associe randonnée sportive, entraînement physique en plein air et brunch local, dans des sites naturels : forêt tropicale, rivières, vues sur la mer des Caraïbes. Les séances d’entraînement (muscles, cardio, souplesse) s’adaptent à chaque niveau.","tags":["Guided Tour"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/randotrainingbrunch","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":false,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/randotrainingbrunch","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/randotrainingbrunch","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/randotrainingbrunch","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/randotrainingbrunch","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/randonnees/randotrainingbrunch","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 77 09 22","address":"Quartier Bout-Barrière, 97226 Le Morne-Vert","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Paypal","Virement bancaire"],"languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"100–150 €"}},{"id":135,"name":"Anse Azerot","type":"activity","lat":14.7709306,"lng":-60.977655,"location":"Sainte-Marie","description":"The last beach on the north Atlantic coast suited to swimming, with showers, toilets, bench tables, barbecues, a grass play area and a large car park. Along the beach are the ruins of an old distillery turned climbing wall, an open-air theatre and an old lime kiln.","description_fr":"Dernière plage de la côte atlantique nord où la baignade est possible, aménagée avec douches, WC, tables, barbecues, pelouse de jeux et vaste parking à l’entrée. Au fil de la plage : ruines d’une ancienne distillerie reconverties en mur d’escalade, scène en plein air et vieux four à chaux.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-azerot","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-azerot","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97230 Sainte-Marie"}},{"id":136,"name":"Anse Caritan","type":"activity","lat":14.427146,"lng":-60.886097,"location":"Sainte-Anne","description":"A pretty little beach near the town of Sainte-Anne with very calm water, good for children to swim. It marks the start of the Trace des Caps hiking trail, a long walk from beach to beach along the Sainte-Anne peninsula to Macabou beach in Le Vauclin.","description_fr":"Tout près du bourg de Sainte-Anne, une jolie petite plage à l’eau très calme, parfaite pour les enfants. Elle donne le coup d’envoi de la Trace des Caps, une longue et belle randonnée de plage en plage qui suit la presqu’île jusqu’à Macabou, au Vauclin.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-caritan","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-caritan","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97227 Sainte-Anne"}},{"id":137,"name":"Anse Ceron","type":"activity","lat":14.8334399,"lng":-61.224283,"location":"Le Prêcheur","description":"A quiet cove north of the town of Le Prêcheur, facing Îlet la Perle and known for its underwater life, shaded by coconut palms and sea-grape trees. The grey-black volcanic sand contrasts with very clear water, and the site has picnic tables and showers.","description_fr":"À l’ombre de cocotiers et de raisiniers, au nord du Prêcheur et en face de l’îlet la Perle, une plage tranquille réputée pour ses fonds marins. Son sable volcanique gris foncé contraste avec une eau très claire ; tables de pique-nique et douches sont à disposition.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-ceron","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-ceron","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97250 Le Precheur"}},{"id":138,"name":"Anse Couleuvre","type":"activity","lat":14.841436,"lng":-61.219428,"location":"Le Prêcheur","description":"Two wild grey-sand beaches at the foot of high cliffs under lush vegetation, at the far north of the Caribbean coast. It attracts experienced surfers and is good for snorkelling among plentiful fish, but visitors should be careful of the current.","description_fr":"Deux plages sauvages de sable gris, au pied de hautes falaises et sous une végétation exubérante, à l’extrême nord de la côte caraïbe. Le lieu attire des surfeurs expérimentés et se prête au snorkeling parmi de nombreux poissons, mais il faut se méfier du courant.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-couleuvre","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-couleuvre","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97250 Le Precheur"}},{"id":139,"name":"Anse Desert","type":"activity","lat":14.4662969,"lng":-60.953185,"location":"Sainte-Luce","description":"A beach lined with sea-grape trees and coconut palms in Sainte-Luce, with room to hang hammocks in the shade and a few picnic tables. A natural pool makes it a safe basin for children, so it is busiest at weekends; the golden sand stretches far and the water is clear and turquoise.","description_fr":"À Sainte-Luce, une plage frangée de raisiniers et de cocotiers où l’on peut suspendre un hamac à l’ombre, avec quelques tables de pique-nique. Un bassin naturel, comme une baignoire, protège les enfants ; la plage est donc surtout animée le week-end. Le sable est doré, l’eau transparente et turquoise.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-desert","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-desert","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97228 Sainte-Luce"}},{"id":140,"name":"Anse Du Carbet","type":"activity","lat":14.7062019,"lng":-61.183947,"location":"Le Carbet","description":"A wide grey-sand beach in Le Carbet, backed by coconut palms and facing the Caribbean Sea, with a view of the mountain. The water is usually calm but waves can batter the beach in north or north-west wind storms. Fishing is important here, and restaurants nearby serve fish specialities.","description_fr":"Une grande plage de sable gris, au Carbet, adossée à des cocotiers et ouverte sur la mer des Caraïbes, avec la montagne en toile de fond. Calme d’ordinaire, elle peut être malmenée par les vagues quand soufflent des vents de nord ou de nord-ouest. La pêche compte beaucoup ici, et les restaurants alentour servent du poisson.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-du-carbet","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-du-carbet","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Carbet, 97221 Le Carbet"}},{"id":141,"name":"Anse Dufour","type":"activity","lat":14.5259092,"lng":-61.089596,"location":"Les Anses-d’Arlet","description":"A white-golden sand beach about a hundred metres from Anse Noire, fairly quiet, with beautiful underwater scenery.","description_fr":"Un peu plus loin que l’Anse Noire, à une centaine de mètres, une plage de sable blanc-doré plutôt tranquille, aux fonds sous-marins superbes.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-dufour","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-dufour","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97217 Les Anses-D''Arlet"}},{"id":142,"name":"Anse Figuier","type":"activity","lat":14.4598377,"lng":-60.910821,"location":"Rivière-Pilote","description":"A beach on the southern beaches road, worth the detour for a family stop on a large lawn shaded by coconut palms and other trees. The water is calm with beautiful seabed (bring a mask), there are a few play items for children, and the Ecomusée de Martinique in an old distillery holds Carib-era remains found on the beach in 1992.","description_fr":"Sur la route des plages du Sud, une plage qui mérite l’arrêt : une grande pelouse ombragée de cocotiers et d’autres arbres se prête aux moments en famille. L’eau est calme, les fonds magnifiques (prévoir un masque), il y a quelques jeux pour enfants, et l’Écomusée de Martinique, installé dans une ancienne distillerie, expose des vestiges de la période caraïbe découverts sur la plage en 1992.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-figuier","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-figuier","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97211 Riviere-Pilote"}},{"id":143,"name":"Anse Grand Macabou","type":"activity","lat":14.4972067,"lng":-60.823247,"location":"Le Vauclin","description":"A wild beach far from any housing, exposed to the trade winds and backed by a huge coconut grove and state forest, with golden sand where good waves sometimes break. It can be reached by car but is best discovered on the walk between Anse Petit Macabou and Anse Baleine.","description_fr":"Isolée et sauvage, cette plage de la côte atlantique reçoit les alizés de plein fouet. Une immense cocoteraie et la forêt domaniale l’encadrent, et de belles vagues déferlent parfois sur son sable doré. On y va en voiture, mais la marche entre les anses Petit Macabou et Baleine est plus belle.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-grand-macabou","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-grand-macabou","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97280 Le Vauclin"}},{"id":144,"name":"Anse A L''ane","type":"activity","lat":14.539957,"lng":-61.06593,"location":"Les Trois-Îlets","description":"A calm-water beach facing Îlet à Ramiers, good for children, lined along its length by hotels and small beach restaurants. A shuttle boat links it with Fort-de-France throughout the day, and it is very popular.","description_fr":"Face à l’îlet à Ramiers, une plage au plan d’eau paisible, adaptée aux enfants, que longent hôtels et petites tables de plage. Des navettes maritimes la relient à Fort-de-France toute la journée ; l’endroit est très fréquenté.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-lane","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-lane","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97229 Les Trois-Ilets"}},{"id":145,"name":"Anse L''etang","type":"activity","lat":14.7661939,"lng":-60.904451,"location":"La Trinité","description":"A long, well-equipped beach of fine sand at the north of the Caravelle peninsula by the last houses of Tartane, with picnic areas and a lifeguard post. Its water is fairly rough because it faces the Atlantic, but the cove is protected by shallows where waves break; families and tourists use it regularly.","description_fr":"Une plage de sable fin, longue et bien équipée (aires de pique-nique, poste de secours), tout au nord de la Caravelle, là où s’arrêtent les maisons de Tartane. Elle regarde l’Atlantique et son eau est assez remuante ; des hauts-fonds font déferler les vagues avant qu’elles n’atteignent l’anse, qui reste protégée. Familles des environs et touristes y viennent volontiers.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-letang","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-letang","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Tartane, 97220 La Trinité"}},{"id":146,"name":"Anse Mabouya","type":"activity","lat":14.4699168,"lng":-60.961821,"location":"Sainte-Luce","description":"The northernmost of the beaches between Trois-Rivières and Sainte-Luce, a pretty beach of blond sand with calm water that is less visited because it is not easy to reach. It is wide and tree-lined, so shade is easy to find, and showers hidden behind trees let you rinse off after swimming.","description_fr":"Plage de sable blond, courte mais agréable, tout au nord de la série de plages entre Trois-Rivières et Sainte-Luce. L’eau est paisible, la fréquentation modeste car l’accès est moins simple, et de grands arbres donnent de l’ombre.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-mabouya","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-mabouya","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97228 Sainte-Luce"}},{"id":147,"name":"Anse Madame","type":"activity","lat":14.6176495,"lng":-61.103599,"location":"Schœlcher","description":"A dark-sand beach with calm water near the centre of Schœlcher and the Cercle Nautique, with a children''s play area.","description_fr":"Une plage de sable noir à l’eau calme, près du bourg de Schœlcher et de son cercle nautique, avec une aire de jeux pour enfants.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-madame","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-madame","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Bourg, 97233 Schoelcher"}},{"id":148,"name":"Anse Meunier","type":"activity","lat":14.4167761,"lng":-60.889187,"location":"Sainte-Anne","description":"A very pretty, fairly wild beach with calm, clear, shallow water, far less busy than the nearby Grande Anse des Salines and reachable along the Trace des Caps coastal path. Shrubs on the beach create small shaded corners; by road, access is along about 2 km of drivable track that leaves the road roughly 2 km before the Salines.","description_fr":"Plage assez sauvage et bien plus tranquille que la Grande Anse des Salines voisine, avec une eau calme, limpide et peu profonde. On la rejoint par la Trace des Caps ou par une piste carrossable d’environ 2 km.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-meunier","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-meunier","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97227 Sainte-Anne"}},{"id":149,"name":"Anse Michel","type":"activity","lat":14.4342738,"lng":-60.830736,"location":"Sainte-Anne","description":"A beautiful shaded beach with clear, shallow water, popular with windsurfers and kitesurfers and with families relaxing at weekends. A few strokes away is Îlet Chevalier, a small paradise facing the Atlantic but sheltered by a coral barrier, reached by boat; at weekends the atmosphere is local and family-friendly.","description_fr":"Une belle plage ombragée, à l’eau cristalline et peu profonde, prisée des véliplanchistes et des kitesurfeurs comme des familles qui viennent s’y détendre le week-end. À quelques brasses, l’îlet Chevalier, petit paradis face à l’Atlantique mais protégé par une barrière de corail, s’atteint en bateau ; le week-end, l’ambiance y est locale et familiale.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-michel","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-michel","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97227 Sainte-Anne"}},{"id":150,"name":"Anse Mitan","type":"activity","lat":14.5523001,"lng":-61.052712,"location":"Les Trois-Îlets","description":"A gently curved beach of white sand at the entrance to the Pointe du Bout peninsula in Les Trois-Îlets, facing the bay of Fort-de-France, close to hotels, restaurants and shops, with many water activities. Boats at anchor sway with the skyline of Fort-de-France and the Pitons du Carbet behind, and a shuttle boat connects it to the capital.","description_fr":"Plage de sable blanc en léger arc de cercle à l’entrée de la Pointe du Bout, face à la baie de Fort-de-France, entourée d’hôtels, de restaurants et de commerces, avec de nombreuses activités nautiques et une navette maritime vers la capitale.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-mitan","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-mitan","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97229 Les Trois-Ilets"}},{"id":151,"name":"Anse Noire","type":"activity","lat":14.5271332,"lng":-61.087823,"location":"Les Anses-d’Arlet","description":"The only black-sand beach in the south of Martinique, a small peaceful cove with crystal-clear water and beautiful underwater scenery, entirely different from Anse Dufour a hundred metres away. It is reached by a large staircase of 130 steps.","description_fr":"Petite crique tranquille aux eaux limpides et aux beaux fonds sous-marins, l’Anse Noire est l’unique plage de sable noir du sud. Elle ne ressemble en rien à l’Anse Dufour, voisine d’une centaine de mètres. Un grand escalier de 130 marches y mène.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-noire","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-noire","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Anses D''arlet, 97217 Les Anses-D''Arlet"}},{"id":152,"name":"Anse Petit Macabou","type":"activity","lat":14.5110486,"lng":-60.822659,"location":"Le Vauclin","description":"A beautiful cove of very white sand edged with vegetation, near the wilder Grand Macabou. Swimmers should not be put off by the seaweed that often covers much of the shore, as the water and the setting are worth the detour. It is the starting point of the Trace des Caps hike, about 27 km to Anse Caritan in Sainte-Anne.","description_fr":"Belle anse de sable très blanc bordée de verdure, plus petite et moins sauvage que le Grand Macabou voisin. Les algues sur le rivage ne doivent pas décourager ; c’est ici que commence la Trace des Caps, environ 27 km jusqu’à l’Anse Caritan.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-petit-macabou","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-petit-macabou","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97280 Le Vauclin"}},{"id":153,"name":"Anse Trabaud","type":"activity","lat":14.4127859,"lng":-60.845757,"location":"Sainte-Anne","description":"A very beautiful fine-sand beach more than a kilometre long on the south Atlantic coast, between Pointe d''Enfer and Pointe Baham. It is little visited because access is fairly difficult: a 15-minute bumpy track over private land with a per-car crossing toll and set entry hours. Often hit by waves, it is liked by bodyboarders and surfers.","description_fr":"Longue plage de sable fin de plus d’un kilomètre sur la côte sud atlantique, peu fréquentée car l’accès se fait par une piste cahoteuse privée, avec péage par voiture et horaires d’entrée. Souvent battue par les vagues, elle attire bodyboarders et surfeurs.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-trabaud","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/anse-trabaud","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97227 Sainte-Anne"}},{"id":154,"name":"Cap Est","type":"activity","lat":14.5905586,"lng":-60.857014,"location":"Le François","description":"A small Atlantic-coast beach in front of the Cap Est Lagoon Resort & Spa, open to everyone by crossing a small stream. A coral barrier offshore keeps the water calm and shallow.","description_fr":"Devant l’hôtel Cap Est Lagoon Resort & Spa, sur la côte atlantique, une petite plage ouverte à tous : il suffit de franchir un petit ruisseau. Au large, la barrière de corail garde l’eau calme et peu profonde.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/cap-est","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/cap-est","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97240 Le François"}},{"id":155,"name":"Cap Macre","type":"activity","lat":14.4483012,"lng":-60.823413,"location":"Le Marin","description":"A beautiful white-sand beach that drops fairly steeply into turquoise water, reached by a long, narrow and rather damaged road with fine views. Big rollers break on the reef offshore, and there is a large shaded area for relaxing, with a few wooden tables.","description_fr":"Une belle plage de sable blanc qui plonge vite dans une eau turquoise. Pour y arriver, il faut emprunter une longue route étroite et abîmée, qui offre de beaux points de vue. À l’horizon, de gros rouleaux éclatent sur la barrière de corail. Une grande zone ombragée permet de se reposer, avec quelques tables en bois.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/cap-macre","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/cap-macre","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97290 Le Marin"}},{"id":156,"name":"Cascade\"An Ba So\"","type":"activity","lat":14.6496663,"lng":-61.10335,"location":"Schœlcher","description":"A family-friendly walk of about 2 km (around an hour, easy, level 1) through dry and semi-humid vegetation to a waterfall where you can cool off. The terrain is slippery in wet weather and the source warns of snakes.","description_fr":"Une balade d’environ 2 km (à peu près une heure, niveau 1) à faire en famille ou entre amis, à travers une végétation sèche et semi-humide, jusqu’à une cascade où l’on peut se rafraîchir. Le terrain est glissant par temps de pluie, et la source signale la présence de serpents.","tags":["Hiking","Waterfall"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/cascadean-ba-so","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/cascadean-ba-so","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Fond lahayé, 97233 Schoelcher"}},{"id":157,"name":"Comité De La Randonnée Pédestre De La Martinique","type":"activity","lat":14.60323255,"lng":-61.0698157,"location":"Fort-de-France","description":"An organisation offering organised hikes, longe-côte and aquatic walking, discovery outings, and hiking stays and trips.","description_fr":"Une organisation qui propose des randonnées, du longe-côte et de la marche aquatique, des sorties découverte, ainsi que des séjours et voyages de randonnée.","tags":["Hiking","Guided Tour"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/comite-de-la-randonnee-pedestre-de-la-martinique","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/comite-de-la-randonnee-pedestre-de-la-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/comite-de-la-randonnee-pedestre-de-la-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/comite-de-la-randonnee-pedestre-de-la-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/comite-de-la-randonnee-pedestre-de-la-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/comite-de-la-randonnee-pedestre-de-la-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/comite-de-la-randonnee-pedestre-de-la-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/comite-de-la-randonnee-pedestre-de-la-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 70 54 88","address":"Comité de la Randonnée Pédestre de la Martinique, 30, rue Ernest Deproge, 97200 Fort-De-France","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Chèques bancaires et postaux","Espèces"],"website":"https://martinique.ffrandonnee.fr/","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/Comit%C3%A9-de-la-Randonn%C3%A9e-P%C3%A9destre-de-la-Martinique-1631832057083212","instagram":"https://instagram.com/ffrandonnee_martinique","languages":["Anglais","Français"]}},{"id":158,"name":"Corps De Garde","type":"activity","lat":14.4665878,"lng":-60.945547,"location":"Sainte-Luce","description":"A beach 3 km from the centre of Sainte-Luce with a very calm sea and a large shaded site, lively with visitors. Facilities include a volleyball net, a sea-water pool said to be the only one in the Antilles, a nautical centre renting kayaks, windsurfers, optimists and catamarans, showers, beach bars and restaurants, and parking.","description_fr":"Une plage à 3 km du bourg de Sainte-Luce, au plan d’eau très calme, sur un vaste site ombragé et animé. On y trouve un filet de volley, une piscine marine présentée comme la seule des Antilles, un centre nautique (location de kayaks, planches à voile, optimists, catamarans), des douches, des bars-restaurants de plage et un parking.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/corps-de-garde","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/corps-de-garde","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97228 Sainte-Luce"}},{"id":159,"name":"Etang Des Salines","type":"activity","lat":14.4062185,"lng":-60.868201,"location":"Sainte-Anne","description":"A coastal lagoon facing Grande Anse des Salines beach, protected by the Conservatoire du littoral since 1998 and recognised as a wetland of international importance under the Ramsar label since 2008. It is little known to visitors; a boardwalk on stilts and a bird observatory let people discover its wildlife and plants.","description_fr":"Face à la plage de la Grande Anse des Salines, cette lagune littorale est protégée depuis 1998 par le Conservatoire du littoral et classée Ramsar depuis 2008, c’est-à-dire zone humide d’importance internationale. Elle est peu connue des visiteurs. Un parcours sur pilotis et un observatoire ornithologique permettent d’en découvrir la faune et la flore.","tags":["Wetland","Nature"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/etang-des-salines","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/etang-des-salines","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97227 Sainte-Anne"}},{"id":160,"name":"Fond Banane","type":"activity","lat":14.4658346,"lng":-60.942102,"location":"Sainte-Luce","description":"A small tree-lined beach of about a hundred metres on the road between Sainte-Luce and Trois-Rivières. Waves can sometimes reach a metre; if the weather worsens, the right-hand end of the beach avoids the current. A small snack stand sells simple dishes, grills, drinks and ice cream.","description_fr":"Une petite plage très arborée, d’une centaine de mètres, en bordure de la route entre Sainte-Luce et Trois-Rivières. Les vagues peuvent parfois atteindre un mètre ; si le temps se dégrade, mieux vaut rester vers l’extrémité droite pour éviter le courant. Un petit snack propose plats simples, grillades, boissons et glaces.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/fond-banane","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/fond-banane","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97228 Sainte-Luce"}},{"id":161,"name":"Foret De Montravail","type":"activity","lat":14.4908378,"lng":-60.9481887,"location":"Sainte-Luce","description":"A 70-hectare humid forest in Sainte-Luce, part of the southern state forest managed by the ONF, offering a cool escape from the heat of the coast. Redeveloped in 2014 and 2015, it has three equipped areas with picnic and rest spaces and looping trails to discover the forest and its streams.","description_fr":"Une forêt humide de 70 hectares à Sainte-Luce, rattachée à la forêt départementalo-domaniale du Sud gérée par l’ONF, où l’on se ressource loin de la chaleur du littoral. Réaménagée en 2014-2015, elle compte trois aires d’accueil avec espaces de pique-nique et de repos, et des sentiers en boucle pour explorer les bois et les cours d’eau.","tags":["Forest","Nature"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/foret-de-montravail","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/foret-de-montravail","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/foret-de-montravail","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/foret-de-montravail","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 60 70 70","address":"Quartier l''Epinay, 97228 Sainte-Luce","website":"https://www.martinique.org/la-martinique-sur-mon-mobile"}},{"id":162,"name":"Foret Vatable","type":"activity","lat":14.5361048,"lng":-61.019956,"location":"Les Trois-Îlets","description":"A coastal state-forest site in Les Trois-Îlets, on the edge of the Génipa Bay mangrove, mostly small-leaved mahogany. The ONF-managed area was redeveloped in 2013–2014 and is accessible to people with reduced mobility; it has picnic areas, wooden boardwalk routes and an amphitheatre decorated by an artist.","description_fr":"Site de la forêt domaniale du littoral, aux Trois-Îlets, au bord de la mangrove de la baie de Génipa. Aménagé par l’ONF et accessible aux personnes à mobilité réduite, il offre des zones de pique-nique, des parcours sur platelage en bois et un amphithéâtre décoré.","tags":["Forest","Nature"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/foret-vatable","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/foret-vatable","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Quartier Vatable, 97229 Les Trois-Ilets"}},{"id":163,"name":"Grande Anse D''arlet","type":"activity","lat":14.5062167,"lng":-61.087793,"location":"Les Anses-d’Arlet","description":"A busy beach, lively at weekends, where you can watch superb sunsets from the terrace of one of the local bar-restaurants. It is a mooring point for many boats.","description_fr":"Plage animée le week-end, où l’on assiste de la terrasse des bars-restaurants à de superbes couchers de soleil. De nombreux bateaux y jettent l’ancre.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/grande-anse-darlet","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/grande-anse-darlet","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97217 Les Anses-D''Arlet"}},{"id":164,"name":"Gros Raisin","type":"activity","lat":14.4658606,"lng":-60.925591,"location":"Sainte-Luce","description":"A shaded beach with calm water close to the town of Sainte-Luce. Visitors can settle at the picnic tables provided or at the snack bars, refreshment stands and restaurants nearby.","description_fr":"Une plage ombragée, à l’eau calme, proche du bourg de Sainte-Luce. On peut s’installer aux tables de pique-nique prévues ou dans les snacks, buvettes et restaurants voisins.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/gros-raisin","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/gros-raisin","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97228 Sainte-Luce"}},{"id":165,"name":"Jardin Atoumo","type":"activity","lat":14.6090068,"lng":-61.046135,"location":"Fort-de-France","description":"A peaceful garden in the Cité Dillon in Fort-de-France where visitors discover Martinique''s endemic and medicinal plants and the island''s plant heritage. Originally focused on teaching, it is a place where generations meet, a few minutes from the town centre.","description_fr":"Jardin tranquille de la Cité Dillon, à Fort-de-France, où l’on découvre les plantes endémiques et médicinales de la Martinique. Lieu pédagogique et de rencontre entre générations, à quelques minutes du centre-ville.","tags":["Garden","Nature"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/jardin-atoumo","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Payment","Languages spoken","Services"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/jardin-atoumo","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/jardin-atoumo","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/jardin-atoumo","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"services":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/jardin-atoumo","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/jardin-atoumo","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 03 84 03","address":"Rue Kann Ribanne, Cité Dillon, 97200 Fort-De-France","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Chèques bancaires et postaux","Chèques vacances","Virement bancaire"],"services":["Boutique"],"languages":["Espagnol","Français"]}},{"id":166,"name":"La Breche","type":"activity","lat":14.7676405,"lng":-60.91087,"location":"La Trinité","description":"A pretty beach of fine sand in an arc facing Tartane bay and its islet, on the east side of the village on the way to the ruins of Château Dubuc. It is one of the few beaches in Martinique fully adapted for people with reduced mobility, and it is well shaded by a row of trees along its length.","description_fr":"Jolie plage de sable fin en arc de cercle, tournée vers la baie de Tartane et son îlet, sur la route des ruines du château Dubuc. Elle est entièrement adaptée aux personnes à mobilité réduite et bien ombragée.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/la-breche","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/la-breche","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97220 La Trinité"}},{"id":167,"name":"Lakou A","type":"activity","lat":14.7285769,"lng":-61.0122,"location":"Gros-Morne","description":"An ecological farm, cultural and visitor space in Gros-Morne devoted to keeping traditional Martinican peasant life and bèlè culture alive: a way of life of dance, song and storytelling to the drum, inherited from the formerly enslaved who settled in the hills. Visitors can join culinary and bèlè dance workshop days.","description_fr":"Au Gros-Morne, un lieu de production agricole écologique, de culture et de visites, voué à la paysannerie martiniquaise traditionnelle et à la culture bèlè. Ce mode de vie, que l’on danse, chante et raconte au son du tambour, vient des anciens esclaves installés dans les mornes. Des journées mêlant atelier de cuisine et danse bèlè sont proposées.","tags":["Garden","Nature"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/lakou","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/lakou","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/lakou","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/lakou","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/lakou","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/lakou","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 17 34 74","address":"Bois Lezard, Chemin la Borélie, 97213 Gros-Morne","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces","Paypal","Virement bancaire"],"languages":["Français"],"priceRange":"25–79 €"}},{"id":168,"name":"Le Domaine De La Vallée","type":"activity","lat":14.78486693,"lng":-61.1440236,"location":"Le Morne-Rouge","description":"A garden at the foot of Montagne Pelée offering stays in nature, meals from its own farm, guided tours of the estate and a Maison de la Vanille telling the story of the vanilla flower and its derived products.","description_fr":"Jardin d’Éden au pied de la montagne Pelée : séjours en pleine nature, repas issus de l’exploitation, visites guidées du domaine et Maison de la Vanille qui raconte l’histoire de cette fleur.","tags":["Garden","Nature"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/le-domaine-de-la-vallee","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Services"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/le-domaine-de-la-vallee","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/le-domaine-de-la-vallee","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/le-domaine-de-la-vallee","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"services":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/le-domaine-de-la-vallee","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/le-domaine-de-la-vallee","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/le-domaine-de-la-vallee","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 52 51 81","address":"Habitation mespont, 97260 Le Morne-Rouge","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"services":["Boutique"],"languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"12–15 €"}},{"id":169,"name":"Le Domaine D’émeraude","type":"activity","lat":14.7495148,"lng":-61.101802,"location":"Le Morne-Rouge","description":"A 24-hectare site between Montagne Pelée and the Pitons du Carbet on the Route de la Trace, devoted to biodiversity and heritage. It has 4 km of landscaped forest walks suited to all ages, an educational exploration pavilion, a Jardin des Origines presenting Caribbean ethnopharmacology, and a park with rare or endemic species.","description_fr":"Domaine de 24 hectares sur la route de la Trace, entre la montagne Pelée et les pitons du Carbet, consacré à la biodiversité : 4 km de forêt aménagée, un pavillon pédagogique, un jardin d’ethnopharmacopée caribéenne et un parc d’espèces rares ou endémiques.","tags":["Garden","Nature"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/le-domaine-demeraude","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Telephone","Address","Website","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Services","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/le-domaine-demeraude","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/le-domaine-demeraude","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/le-domaine-demeraude","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/le-domaine-demeraude","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"services":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/le-domaine-demeraude","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/le-domaine-demeraude","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/le-domaine-demeraude","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 52 33 49","address":"Quartier Propreté – Route de la Trace, 97260 Le Morne-Rouge","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Chèques bancaires et postaux","Chèques vacances","Tickets restaurant"],"website":"https://pnr-martinique.com/","services":["Boutique"],"languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"5–9 €"},"opening_periods":[{"day":0,"opens":540,"closes":960},{"day":1,"opens":540,"closes":960},{"day":2,"opens":540,"closes":960},{"day":3,"opens":540,"closes":960},{"day":4,"opens":540,"closes":960},{"day":5,"opens":540,"closes":960},{"day":6,"opens":540,"closes":960}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/le-domaine-demeraude","hours_updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:32:05.387867+00:00"},{"id":170,"name":"Le Trou Caraibe","type":"activity","lat":14.73134788,"lng":-61.1786434,"location":"Le Carbet","description":"A passage cut through a coastal rock at Anse Turin in Le Carbet. A huge rock once blocked the coastal path to Saint-Pierre, forcing a 7 km detour or a trip by sea, until the priest Goux had the old passage widened in 1854.","description_fr":"Un passage taillé dans un rocher côtier à l’Anse Turin, au Carbet. Un énorme rocher barrait autrefois le chemin du littoral vers Saint-Pierre : il fallait faire 7 km de détour ou passer par la mer, jusqu’à ce que le père Goux fasse élargir l’ancien passage en 1854.","tags":["Heritage"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/le-trou-caraibe","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/le-trou-caraibe","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Anse Turin, 97221 Le Carbet"}},{"id":171,"name":"Les Jardins De Denel","type":"activity","lat":14.71880808,"lng":-60.9939699,"location":"Gros-Morne","description":"A visit linked to Denel, a Martinican company in Gros-Morne with know-how developed since 1905 that processes fruit from its own farming and from some fifty local growers into juices, jams and other specialities, highlighting local produce and heritage.","description_fr":"Une visite liée à Denel, entreprise martiniquaise du Gros-Morne qui exploite depuis 1905 un savoir-faire de transformation des fruits, issus de sa propre activité agricole et d’une cinquantaine de producteurs locaux, en jus, confitures et autres spécialités.","tags":["Garden","Nature"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/les-jardins-de-denel","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Services","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/les-jardins-de-denel","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/les-jardins-de-denel","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/les-jardins-de-denel","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/les-jardins-de-denel","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"services":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/les-jardins-de-denel","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/les-jardins-de-denel","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/les-jardins-de-denel","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 67 97 83","address":"Usine Royal, Quartier Denel, 97213 Gros-Morne","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"website":"https://www.denelmartinique.store/","services":["Boutique"],"languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"5–8 €"},"opening_periods":[{"day":3,"opens":570,"closes":690}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/les-jardins-de-denel","hours_updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:32:05.800301+00:00"},{"id":172,"name":"Les Pitons Du Carbet","type":"activity","lat":14.7052194,"lng":-61.134494,"location":"Le Carbet","description":"A volcanic massif in northern Martinique, thought to be the island''s oldest mountains, older than Montagne Pelée, and with Pelée the best natural viewpoint on the island. Thick humid tropical forest with tall tree ferns, anthuriums, heliconias and bamboo covers it, thinning above 800 m. The map marks the massif rather than a verified trailhead, so plan a route with a qualified guide.","description_fr":"Massif volcanique du nord de la Martinique, réputé plus ancien que la montagne Pelée, couvert d’une dense forêt tropicale humide qui s’éclaircit au-delà de 800 m. La carte repère le massif et non un départ de sentier vérifié : choisissez l’itinéraire avec un guide qualifié.","tags":["Mountain","Nature"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/les-pitons-du-carbet","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/les-pitons-du-carbet","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Morne Vert, 97224 Le Carbet"}},{"id":173,"name":"L''îlet Sainte Marie Et Son Tombolo","type":"activity","lat":14.7877642,"lng":-60.989287,"location":"Sainte-Marie","description":"A former port islet facing the town of Sainte-Marie, joined to the beach by a curious sand strip called a tombolo. This natural effect of swells, tides and currents appears each year in the dry season (roughly January to April); when the sand is dry the islet can be reached on foot. Access depends on sea conditions and local instructions.","description_fr":"Face au bourg de Sainte-Marie, l’îlet est un ancien port que rattache à la plage une étrange langue de sable, le tombolo. Ce phénomène naturel, produit par les houles, les marées et les courants, apparaît chaque année pendant la saison sèche, le Carême (environ de janvier à avril) ; sable à sec, on peut rejoindre l’îlet à pied. L’accès dépend de la mer et des consignes locales.","tags":["Natural Site"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/lilet-sainte-marie-et-son-tombolo","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Telephone","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/lilet-sainte-marie-et-son-tombolo","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/lilet-sainte-marie-et-son-tombolo","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 58 69 98","address":"97230 Sainte-Marie"}},{"id":174,"name":"An Mao Héritage","type":"activity","lat":14.4716982,"lng":-60.890943,"location":"Le Marin","description":"A memorial site on the land once lived on by the founder''s ancestors, showing how they used it under slavery through marronage and later as free people after abolition. It is rich in memorials, century-old trees, rare medicinal plants, panoramas and legends, with a knowledgeable guide.","description_fr":"Un lieu de mémoire sur la terre qu’habitaient jadis les ancêtres de son créateur, qui montre comment ils l’ont investie sous l’esclavage par le marronnage, puis comme femmes et hommes libres après l’abolition. On y trouve des mémoriaux, des arbres centenaires, des plantes médicinales rares, des panoramas et des légendes, avec un guide érudit.","tags":["Heritage","Garden"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/mao-heritage","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Social media","Payment","Languages spoken","Services"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/mao-heritage","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/mao-heritage","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/mao-heritage","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/mao-heritage","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"services":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/mao-heritage","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/mao-heritage","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 74 06 04","address":"Morne Gommier, Lieu-dit FILETTE, 97290 Le Marin","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Virement bancaire"],"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/anmaomornegommier","services":["Boutique"],"languages":["Anglais","Français"]}},{"id":175,"name":"Plage De Bateliere","type":"activity","lat":14.6050502,"lng":-61.096073,"location":"Schœlcher","description":"The only white-sand beach in the commune of Schœlcher, at the Hôtel Batelière site, with a bar-restaurant, parasols and a diving club nearby.","description_fr":"À Schœlcher, l’unique plage de sable blanc, sur le site de l’hôtel Batelière : bar-restaurant, parasols, et un club de plongée tout proche.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/plage-de-bateliere","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/plage-de-bateliere","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Hôtel Batelière, 97233 Schoelcher"}},{"id":176,"name":"Plage De Cosmy","type":"activity","lat":14.7507502,"lng":-60.966145,"location":"La Trinité","description":"A beach just after the town of La Trinité, very quiet on weekdays but popular at weekends and school holidays with local families who often spend the whole day. It has tables, benches and plenty of shade; the access road leaves the north end of town towards Résidence Cosmy.","description_fr":"Une plage juste après le bourg de La Trinité, très calme en semaine mais prisée le week-end et pendant les vacances scolaires par les familles du coin, qui y passent souvent la journée. Elle dispose de tables, de bancs et de nombreuses zones d’ombre ; une petite route part de la sortie nord de la ville, vers la Résidence Cosmy.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/plage-de-cosmy","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/plage-de-cosmy","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97220 La Trinité"}},{"id":177,"name":"Plage De Dizac","type":"activity","lat":14.4776073,"lng":-61.026186,"location":"Le Diamant","description":"The huge beach of Le Diamant, facing the rock and lined with undergrowth along the D37. White sand slopes into very clear water, and picnic tables are provided. The sea can be rough and the current strong, so supervise children closely.","description_fr":"L’immense plage du Diamant, face au Rocher, longe la D37 sous un sous-bois. Sable blanc, eau très claire, tables de pique-nique ; mais la mer est parfois houleuse et le courant souvent fort, ce qui demande une vigilance accrue, surtout avec des enfants.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/plage-de-dizac","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/plage-de-dizac","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97223 Le Diamant"}},{"id":178,"name":"Plage Pointe La Rose","type":"activity","lat":14.6508809,"lng":-60.889864,"location":"Le Robert","description":"A small sand-and-pebble beach, also called baie Coco, near a mangrove pool and a lime kiln in Le Robert. It is little visited because it is hard to reach. A coral barrier offshore keeps the water calm and shallow, with many colourful fish within 100 m of the shore.","description_fr":"Une petite plage de sable et de galets, aussi appelée baie Coco, près d’un marigot et d’un four à chaux, au Robert. Peu fréquentée car difficile d’accès. La barrière de corail au large calme l’eau, peu profonde, où abondent des poissons colorés à moins de 100 m du rivage.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/plage-pointe-la-rose","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/plage-pointe-la-rose","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97231 Le Robert"}},{"id":179,"name":"Point De Vue Du Morne Gommier - Vision Panoramique À 360°","type":"activity","lat":14.4752916,"lng":-60.865976,"location":"Le Marin","description":"A 360-degree panorama from the heights of Morne Gommier above Le Marin, taking in the town and its marina, Sainte-Anne, the Atlantic coast and its capes, Saint Lucia, Diamond Rock, the Pitons du Carbet, Montagne Pelée and more.","description_fr":"Un panorama à 360 degrés depuis les hauteurs du Morne Gommier, au-dessus du Marin : la ville et sa marina, Sainte-Anne, la côte atlantique et ses caps, Sainte-Lucie, le Rocher du Diamant, les pitons du Carbet, la montagne Pelée et bien d’autres repères.","tags":["Viewpoint"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/point-de-vue-du-morne-gommier-vision-panoramique-360deg","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/point-de-vue-du-morne-gommier-vision-panoramique-360deg","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/point-de-vue-du-morne-gommier-vision-panoramique-360deg","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/point-de-vue-du-morne-gommier-vision-panoramique-360deg","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/point-de-vue-du-morne-gommier-vision-panoramique-360deg","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 74 25 01","address":"Le Morne Gommier, 97290 Le Marin","website":"https://www.mornegommier.fr/","facebook":"https://business.facebook.com/Morne-Gommier-467378143439920/timeline"}},{"id":180,"name":"Pointe Faula","type":"activity","lat":14.5429045,"lng":-60.826626,"location":"Le Vauclin","description":"A lagoon-side beach in Le Vauclin with calm, breezy water facing a coral-barrier lagoon, good for resting under sea-grape trees and coconut palms or at the small restaurants and snacks. Children enjoy the sandy bottom covered by about ten centimetres of water out to the white shallows, which feels like walking on water.","description_fr":"Une plage du Vauclin face à un lagon fermé par la barrière de corail, à l’eau calme et bien ventilée, pour se reposer sous les raisiniers et les cocotiers ou dans les petits restaurants et snacks. Les enfants adorent le fond sableux recouvert d’une dizaine de centimètres d’eau jusqu’aux fonds blancs, qui donne l’impression de marcher sur l’eau.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/pointe-faula","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/pointe-faula","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97280 Le Vauclin"}},{"id":181,"name":"Pointe Marin","type":"activity","lat":14.4427105,"lng":-60.881591,"location":"Sainte-Anne","description":"A long beach at the entrance to Sainte-Anne, very busy at weekends, with very calm water that suits children. Several refreshment stands and snacks line the beach, clubs rent water-sports equipment and run dives, and a campsite rents canvas bungalows and caravans.","description_fr":"Une longue plage à l’entrée du bourg de Sainte-Anne, très animée le week-end, à l’eau très calme, appréciée des enfants. Plusieurs buvettes et snacks la bordent, des clubs louent du matériel nautique et organisent des plongées, et un camping propose bungalows en toile et caravanes.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/pointe-marin","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/pointe-marin","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97227 Sainte-Anne"}},{"id":182,"name":"Pont Cafe","type":"activity","lat":14.4649256,"lng":-60.938829,"location":"Sainte-Luce","description":"A small, shaded white-sand beach with calm water right next to the Pierre & Vacances residence and its nautical base, which offers catamaran, jet-ski, pedalo and sea-kayak hire. It has a few picnic tables and is extremely quiet because few people come.","description_fr":"Une petite plage de sable blanc ombragée, à l’eau calme, juste à côté de la résidence Pierre & Vacances et de sa base nautique (location de catamarans, jet-skis, pédalos, kayaks de mer). Quelques tables de pique-nique, et une grande tranquillité car la plage est très peu fréquentée.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/pont-cafe","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/pont-cafe","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97228 Sainte-Luce"}},{"id":183,"name":"Tartane","type":"activity","lat":14.7606492,"lng":-60.915961,"location":"La Trinité","description":"A pretty little fine-sand beach in the middle of the village of Tartane, with a children''s play area and small huts used by local fishermen. In the shade of the trees you can watch the fishing boats return and fish being sold on the spot. The calm water suits children, and there are public showers and toilets.","description_fr":"Au milieu du bourg de Tartane, une jolie petite plage de sable fin avec aire de jeux et petites cases de pêcheurs. Sous les arbres, on assiste au retour de pêche et à la vente du poisson. Grâce aux hauts-fonds, l’eau calme convient bien aux enfants ; douche et WC publics.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/tartane","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/tartane","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97220 La Trinité"}},{"id":184,"name":"Vanille Volkanik","type":"activity","lat":14.76622365,"lng":-61.1153259,"location":"Le Morne-Rouge","description":"A vanilla plantation within a tropical agro-farm in Le Morne-Rouge, visited as an all-nature immersion: first the farm''s fruit, vegetables and spices, then the vanilla plantation with historical, cultural and botanical explanations from a guide.","description_fr":"Une vanilleraie nichée dans une agro-ferme tropicale du Morne-Rouge, que l’on visite en pleine nature : d’abord les fruits, légumes et épices de la ferme, puis la plantation de vanille, avec des explications historiques, culturelles et botaniques données par un guide.","tags":["Farm Visit","Vanilla"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/vanille-volkanik","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/vanille-volkanik","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/vanille-volkanik","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/vanille-volkanik","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/vanille-volkanik","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/vanille-volkanik","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"97260 Le Morne-Rouge","payment":["Cartes bancaires"],"instagram":"https://instagram.com/petitcocotier.co","languages":["Français"],"priceRange":"6–10 €"},"opening_periods":[{"day":1,"opens":660,"closes":750},{"day":2,"opens":660,"closes":750},{"day":4,"opens":660,"closes":750},{"day":6,"opens":660,"closes":750}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/vanille-volkanik","hours_updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:32:07.765848+00:00"},{"id":185,"name":"Zoo De Martinique-Habitation Anse Latouche","type":"activity","lat":14.731364,"lng":-61.1774164,"location":"Le Carbet","description":"A zoo on Habitation Latouche in Le Carbet, one of the island''s oldest estates (founded 1643), classified a Jardin Remarquable. The route crosses a green valley with historic remains, natural pools and lush vegetation, where jaguars, pumas, spider monkeys, flamingos, parrots and many tropical species can be seen.","description_fr":"Le Zoo de Martinique occupe l’habitation Latouche, au Carbet, fondée en 1643 et classée Jardin remarquable. La visite mêle animaux, jardin tropical et patrimoine historique : une vallée verdoyante avec vestiges, bassins naturels et végétation dense, où vivent jaguars, pumas, atèles, flamants des Caraïbes, perroquets et bien d’autres espèces tropicales.","tags":["Zoo","Garden"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/zoo-de-martinique-habitation-anse-latouche","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Services","Accessibility","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/zoo-de-martinique-habitation-anse-latouche","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/zoo-de-martinique-habitation-anse-latouche","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/zoo-de-martinique-habitation-anse-latouche","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/zoo-de-martinique-habitation-anse-latouche","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/zoo-de-martinique-habitation-anse-latouche","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"services":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/zoo-de-martinique-habitation-anse-latouche","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/zoo-de-martinique-habitation-anse-latouche","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/zoo-de-martinique-habitation-anse-latouche","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/zoo-de-martinique-habitation-anse-latouche","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"accessibility":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/zoo-de-martinique-habitation-anse-latouche","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 52 76 08","address":"Quartier Anse la Touche, 97221 Le Carbet","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Chèques bancaires et postaux","Chèques vacances"],"website":"https://www.zoodemartinique.com/","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/zoodemartinique","services":["Boutique"],"instagram":"https://instagram.com/zoodemartinique","languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"12–32 €","accessibility":"Déficience moteur"},"opening_periods":[{"day":0,"opens":540,"closes":1080},{"day":1,"opens":540,"closes":1080},{"day":2,"opens":540,"closes":1080},{"day":3,"opens":540,"closes":1080},{"day":4,"opens":540,"closes":1080},{"day":5,"opens":540,"closes":1080},{"day":6,"opens":540,"closes":1080}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/zoo-de-martinique-habitation-anse-latouche","hours_updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:32:08.052444+00:00"},{"id":186,"name":"Abaca Dive  -  Espace Plongée Martinique","type":"activity","lat":14.55909536,"lng":-61.0513084,"location":"Les Trois-Îlets","description":"A diving school in Les Trois-Îlets offering introductory dives, exploration, training, children''s diving and dives for disabled divers, from two boats (a catamaran and a launch). Two half-day departures a day cover sites from Diamond Rock to Îlet la Perle, including the Saint-Pierre wrecks and the Nahoon wreck.","description_fr":"Une école de plongée des Trois-Îlets qui propose baptêmes, plongées d’exploration, formations, plongée pour enfants et pour plongeurs en situation de handicap, depuis deux bateaux (un catamaran et une vedette). Deux départs en demi-journée chaque jour desservent des sites du Rocher du Diamant à l’îlet la Perle, dont les épaves de Saint-Pierre et celle du Nahoon.","tags":["Diving"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/abaca-dive-espace-plongee-martinique","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Accessibility","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/abaca-dive-espace-plongee-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/abaca-dive-espace-plongee-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/abaca-dive-espace-plongee-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/abaca-dive-espace-plongee-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/abaca-dive-espace-plongee-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/abaca-dive-espace-plongee-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/abaca-dive-espace-plongee-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/abaca-dive-espace-plongee-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"accessibility":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/abaca-dive-espace-plongee-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 66 01 79","address":"Marina de la pointe du bout, 97229 Les Trois-Ilets","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Chèques bancaires et postaux","Chèques vacances","Espèces","Virement bancaire"],"website":"https://www.espaceplongee-martinique.com/","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/pages/ESPACE-PLONGEE-MARTINIQUE-page-officielle/229257717116247","instagram":"https://instagram.com/epm972","languages":["Allemand","Anglais","Espagnol","Français","Italien","Langue des signes"],"priceRange":"25–70 €","accessibility":"Déficience auditive, Déficience moteur, Déficience visuelle"},"opening_periods":[{"day":0,"opens":510,"closes":720},{"day":0,"opens":840,"closes":1080},{"day":1,"opens":510,"closes":720},{"day":1,"opens":840,"closes":1080},{"day":2,"opens":510,"closes":720},{"day":2,"opens":840,"closes":1080},{"day":3,"opens":510,"closes":720},{"day":3,"opens":840,"closes":1080},{"day":4,"opens":510,"closes":720},{"day":4,"opens":840,"closes":1080},{"day":5,"opens":510,"closes":720},{"day":5,"opens":840,"closes":1080},{"day":6,"opens":510,"closes":720},{"day":6,"opens":840,"closes":1080}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/abaca-dive-espace-plongee-martinique","hours_updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:32:08.340114+00:00"},{"id":187,"name":"Abc Dive Plongée Martinique","type":"activity","lat":14.5534966,"lng":-61.052419,"location":"Les Trois-Îlets","description":"A dive centre at Anse Mitan in Les Trois-Îlets, created in December 2017 with the aim of sharing the beauty of Caribbean underwater life. Four instructors welcome learners and experienced divers in a friendly, family atmosphere, in spacious premises on the shore of the bay.","description_fr":"Un centre de plongée à l’Anse Mitan, aux Trois-Îlets, créé en décembre 2017 pour faire partager la beauté de la vie sous-marine caribéenne. Quatre moniteurs accueillent débutants comme confirmés dans une ambiance familiale, dans des locaux spacieux au bord de la baie.","tags":["Diving"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/abc-dive-plongee-martinique","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/abc-dive-plongee-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/abc-dive-plongee-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/abc-dive-plongee-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/abc-dive-plongee-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www