k en eaux claires, journée en 4x4 avec chauffeur-guide et plongée sous-marine.","tags":["Guided Tour","Water Sports"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/activites-martinique","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/activites-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/activites-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/activites-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/activites-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/activites-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/activites-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/activites-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/activites-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 54 08 89","address":"Résidence hôtelière Flamboyant, Anse mitan, 97229 Les Trois-Ilets","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Chèques bancaires et postaux","Chèques vacances","Espèces","Paypal","Virement bancaire"],"website":"https://www.activites-martinique.com/","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/activitesmartinique","instagram":"https://instagram.com/activitesmartinique","languages":["Anglais","Espagnol","Français","Italien"],"priceRange":"60–100 €"}},{"id":189,"name":"Adventur''o","type":"activity","lat":14.55987877,"lng":-60.8598522,"location":"Le Vauclin","description":"A provider of electric underwater scooters and MiniDive for exploring coral reefs at your own pace. Child and adult models, usable from age 8, let the whole family get close to fish and coral while holding their breath, without effort.","description_fr":"Un loueur de scooters sous-marins électriques et de MiniDive pour découvrir les récifs coralliens à son rythme. Des modèles enfants et adultes, accessibles dès 8 ans, permettent à toute la famille de s’approcher sans effort des poissons et des coraux, en apnée.","tags":["Underwater Scooter","Water Sports"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/adventuro","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Social media","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/adventuro","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/adventuro","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/adventuro","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/adventuro","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/adventuro","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 38 17 01","address":"Chemin Rural de Ravine Plate, 97280 Le Vauclin","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Chèques vacances","Espèces","Virement bancaire"],"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/AdventurO-105289998590808","languages":["Français"]}},{"id":190,"name":"Alize Fun Martinique","type":"activity","lat":14.43657257,"lng":-60.8266006,"location":"Sainte-Anne","description":"A French kitesurf school and windsurf centre on Anse Michel beach at Cap Chevalier, with state-qualified instructors, in wind and white sand protected by the coral barrier.","description_fr":"École française de kitesurf et de planche à voile à Cap Chevalier, sur la plage de l’anse Michel, avec moniteurs diplômés d’État ; le vent y souffle sur du sable blanc, et la barrière de corail protège le plan d’eau.","tags":["Kitesurf"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/alize-fun-martinique","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/alize-fun-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/alize-fun-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/alize-fun-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/alize-fun-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/alize-fun-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/alize-fun-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/alize-fun-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/alize-fun-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 91 71 06","a