let","description":"A dive centre approved by FFESSM and PADI offering introductory dives, diver training and exploration dives for all levels, plus snorkelling trips at its Grande Anse dive sites.","description_fr":"Un centre de plongée agréé FFESSM et PADI, qui propose baptêmes, formations et plongées d’exploration pour tous niveaux, ainsi que de la randonnée palmée sur ses sites de Grande Anse.","tags":["Diving"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/alpha-plongee-martinique","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/alpha-plongee-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/alpha-plongee-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/alpha-plongee-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/alpha-plongee-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/alpha-plongee-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/alpha-plongee-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/alpha-plongee-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 48 30 34","address":"138 rue Robert Deloy, Grande Anse, 97217 Les Anses-D''Arlet","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Chèques bancaires et postaux","Chèques vacances","Virement bancaire"],"website":"https://www.alphaplongee.com/","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/alphaplongee.martinique","languages":["Anglais","Espagnol","Français"],"priceRange":"55 €"}},{"id":193,"name":"Amphitrite","type":"activity","lat":14.64189858,"lng":-61.1385504,"location":"Case-Pilote","description":"A small-group boat day aboard Amphitrite with a choice of outings: a morning looking for cetaceans and dolphins, a north Caribbean day with dolphins, wild coves, a stop in Saint-Pierre and a homemade lunch, a sunset trip with an aperitif on board, a tailor-made or private-boat day, or traditional and sport fishing.","description_fr":"Journées en petit comité à bord d’Amphitrite, avec plusieurs formules : matinée cétacés et dauphins ; journée nord Caraïbe (dauphins, criques sauvages, escale à Saint-Pierre, repas maison, baignade au-dessus du corail) ; balade apéro au coucher du soleil ; journée à la carte avec bateau privatisé ; ou pêche traditionnelle et sportive.","tags":["Boat Trip"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/amphitrite","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/amphitrite","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/amphitrite","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/amphitrite","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/amphitrite","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/amphitrite","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org