h from the Fountaine Pajot yard in November 2023, taking up to 10 people in four double cabins with independent washrooms, with good autonomy in water and electricity.","description_fr":"Une croisière avec skipper à bord du Bel Mondo, catamaran Elba 45 sorti des chantiers Fountaine Pajot en novembre 2023, pour 10 personnes au maximum dans quatre cabines doubles avec cabinets de toilette indépendants, avec une bonne autonomie en eau et en électricité.","tags":["Boat Trip"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/bel-mondo","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/bel-mondo","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/bel-mondo","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/bel-mondo","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/bel-mondo","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"Port de Plaisance, 97290 Le Marin","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Virement bancaire"],"languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"350–1300 €"}},{"id":204,"name":"Bleue Evasion","type":"activity","lat":14.5400749,"lng":-61.035996,"location":"Les Trois-Îlets","description":"Boat trips that show Martinique from the sea: north to Anse Couleuvre along the Caribbean coast with views of the Pitons du Carbet, Montagne Pelée, the bay of Saint-Pierre and coral reefs, or south to Diamond Rock with its birds and seabed, passing Anse Noire.","description_fr":"Sorties en mer pour voir l’île depuis l’eau : vers le nord jusqu’à l’Anse Couleuvre (pitons du Carbet, montagne Pelée, baie 