:00"},{"id":205,"name":"Blue Dream Croisières","type":"activity","lat":14.5314313,"lng":-61.011995,"location":"Les Trois-Îlets","description":"Day or multi-day catamaran cruises from the Village de la Poterie in Les Trois-Îlets, with an experienced captain, small groups and comfortable facilities such as sunbathing areas and a shaded cockpit. Two circuits are offered, one towards Le Diamant (bay of Fort-de-France, Diamond Rock, Anses d''Arlet).","description_fr":"Croisières en catamaran d’un jour ou plus depuis le Village de la Poterie, aux Trois-Îlets, avec un capitaine expérimenté et un petit groupe. Le bateau est confortable (solarium, cockpit couvert, salon lounge) et deux circuits sont proposés, dont le Diamant.","tags":["Boat Trip","Sailing"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/blue-dream-croisieres","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/blue-dream-croisieres","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/blue-dream-croisieres","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/blue-dream-croisieres","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/blue-dream-croisieres","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/blue-dream-croisieres","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/blue-dream-croisieres","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/blue-dream-croisieres","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 61 00 16","address":"Village de la Poterie, 97229 Les Trois-Ilets","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Chèques bancaires et postaux","Chèques vacances","Espèces","Paypal","Virement bancaire"],"website":"https://www.bluedream-croisieres.com/","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/BlueDreamCroisieres","languages":["Anglais","Espagnol","Français","Italien"],"priceRange":"100 €"}},{"id":206,"name":"Blue Lagoon Kitesurf","type":"activity","lat":14.5691758,"lng":-60.846821,"location":"Le Vauclin","description":"A kitesurf school in Le Vauclin with one instructor for two beginner students and personalised lessons, with wind, sun, white shallows and a large lagoon reachable only by boat.","description_fr":"Une école de kitesurf au Vauclin, avec un moniteur pour deux élèves débutants et des cours personnalisés, entre vent, soleil, fonds blancs et grand lagon accessible uniquement en bateau.","tags":["Kitesurf"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/blue-lagoon-kitesurf","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/blue-lagoon-kitesurf","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/blue-lagoon-kitesurf","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/blue-lagoon-kitesurf","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/blue-lagoon-kitesurf","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/blue-lagoon-kitesurf","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/blue-lagoon-kitesurf","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 94 81 63","address":"21 rue flamboyants, baie des mulets, 97280 Le Vauclin","payment":["Chèques bancaires et postaux","Espèces"],"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/bluelagoonkitesurf","languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"30–100 €"}},{"id":207,"name":"Boucaniers Diving","type":"activity","lat":14.45024869,"lng":-60.8836243,"location":"Sainte-Anne","description":"A friendly family dive centre on the public beach of Club Med Les Boucaniers in Sainte-Anne offering introductory dives, discovery, training and exploration, with a spacious boat for up to 38 divers and 38 sets of equipment renewed each year.","description_fr":"Centre de plongée familial à Sainte-Anne, sur la plage publique du Club Med Les Boucaniers. Baptêmes, découverte, formation et exploration, avec un bateau de 38 places et 38 équipements complets remplacés chaque année.","tags":["Diving"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/boucaniers-diving","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/boucaniers-diving","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/boucaniers-diving","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/boucaniers-diving","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/boucaniers-diving","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/boucaniers-diving","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 63 20 64","address":"La Pointe Marin, 97227 Sainte-Anne","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"languages":["Anglais","Espagnol","Français"],"priceRange":"79 €"},"opening_periods":[{"day":0,"opens":480,"closes":780},{"day":0,"opens":870,"closes":1020},{"day":1,"opens":480,"closes":780},{"day":1,"opens":870,"closes":1020},{"day":2,"opens":480,"closes":780},{"day":2,"opens":870,"closes":1020},{"day":3,"opens":480,"closes":780},{"day":3,"opens":870,"closes":1020},{"day":4,"opens":480,"closes":780},{"day":4,"opens":870,"closes":1020},{"day":5,"opens":480,"closes":780},{"day":5,"opens":870,"closes":1020}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/boucaniers-diving","hours_updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:32:12.243765+00:00"},{"id":208,"name":"Bubble Dive Plongée","type":"activity","lat":14.5178097,"lng":-61.093917,"location":"Les Anses-d’Arlet","description":"A diving club that keeps groups very small, aboard a traditional yole, with a state-qualified instructor. About fifteen dive sites lie between Diamond Rock and Anse Dufour, including the Anses d''Arlet sites (Pointe Burgos, Jorasses, Pointe Lézarde, Cap Salomon, the Nahoon).","description_fr":"Club de plongée en très petit comité, sur une yole traditionnelle, avec une monitrice brevetée d’État. Une quinzaine de sites de plongée s’échelonnent du Rocher du Diamant à l’Anse Dufour, y compris tous ceux des Anses-d’Arlet.","tags":["Diving"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/bubble-dive-plongee","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https: