laisance du François : baies du François et du Robert, de l’îlet Chancel à l’îlet Oscar, avec la baignoire de Joséphine.","tags":["Jet Ski"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/c-jet-ski","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/c-jet-ski","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/c-jet-ski","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/c-jet-ski","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/c-jet-ski","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/c-jet-ski","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/c-jet-ski","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 24 05 74","address":"Pointe Bateau, 97240 Le François","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces"],"website":"https://cjetski.com/","languages":["Français"],"priceRange":"90 €"}},{"id":210,"name":"Calypso-Croisieres","type":"activity","lat":14.5021663,"lng":-61.084072,"location":"Les Anses-d’Arlet","description":"Sailing trips in the turquoise waters of the island of flowers: dolphin encounters, seabed discovery and swimming with turtles. The highlight is a week-long catamaran Tour of Martinique''s distilleries, with deserted coves reachable only by sea and hiking.","description_fr":"Sorties à la voile dans les eaux turquoise de la Martinique : dauphins, fonds marins, baignade avec les tortues. Le Tour de la Martinique des distilleries, une semaine en catamaran, ajoute des criques désertes accessibles par la mer et des randonnées.","tags":["Boat Trip"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/calypso-croisieres","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/calypso-croisieres","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/calypso-croisieres","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/calypso-croisieres","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/calypso-croisieres","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/calypso-croisieres","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/calypso-croisieres","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/calypso-croisieres","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 51 90 54","address":"Avenue Robert Deloy, Grande Anse, 97217 Les Anses-D''Arlet","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Chèques vacances","Virement bancaire"],"website":"https://www.calypso-croisieres.com/tour-de-martinique-catamaran","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/Calypso-Croisieres-193603774179277","languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"50–90 €"},"opening_periods":[{"day":1,"opens":480,"closes":720},{"day":1,"opens":780,"closes":1080},{"day":2,"opens":480,"closes":720},{"day":2,"opens":780,"closes":1080},{"day":3,"opens":480,"close