ades sur canapé, matelas ou flyfish tractés, dans une ambiance locale et décontractée.","tags":["Water Sports"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/coco-fly","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Opening hours","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/coco-fly","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/coco-fly","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/coco-fly","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"hoursText":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/coco-fly","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/coco-fly","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 07 78 80","address":"111 Domaine Du Fort D''alet, 97229 Les Trois-Ilets","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Chèques bancaires et postaux","Chèques vacances"],"hoursText":"Mercredi : À partir de 13h00, À partir de 17h00\nJeudi : À partir de 13h00, À partir de 17h00\nVendredi : À partir de 13h00, À partir de 17h00\nSamedi : À partir de 10h00, À partir de 17h30\nDimanche : À partir de 10h00, À partir de 17h30","languages":["Anglais","Espagnol"]}},{"id":221,"name":"Corail Club Caraibes","type":"activity","lat":14.53994347,"lng":-61.0659723,"location":"Les Trois-Îlets","description":"A dive centre (SEA Scubapro centre since 1994) showing the best seabeds of the Caribbean coast from north to south, with pool introductions if needed, first sea dives and exploration dives at sites around Martinique.","description_fr":"Un centre de plongée (centre SEA Scubapro depuis 1994) qui fait découvrir les plus beaux fonds 