scription_fr":"Des sorties en bateau d’une journée ou d’une demi-journée avec un père et son fils, une vingtaine d’années d’expérience dans le tourisme, pour voir les îlets du François et du Robert, parmi les plus beaux de la Martinique, au départ du port de pêche du François, le long des récifs coralliens.","tags":["Boat Trip"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/denis-excursions","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/denis-excursions","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/denis-excursions","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/denis-excursions","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/denis-excursions","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/denis-excursions","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/denis-excursions","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 44 46 46","address":"Port de pêche du François, 97240 Le François","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces","Virement bancaire"],"website":"https://www.denisexcursions.com/","languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"50 €"}},{"id":229,"name":"Diaj","type":"activity","lat":14.731661,"lng":-61.179,"location":"Le Carbet","description":"A dive centre based at Madi Créoles at the entrance to Saint-Pierre, diving inside the Albert Falco reserve, a protected natural and historical heritage at the foot of Montagne Pelée, where the volcano created unique north Caribbean sites.","description_fr":"Un centre de plongée installé à Madi Créoles, à l’entrée de Saint-Pierre, qui plonge dans la réserve Albert Falco, un patrimoine naturel et historique protégé au pied de la montagne Pelée, à l’origine de sites uniques du nord Caraïbe.","tags":["Diving"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/diaj","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/diaj","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/diaj","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/diaj","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/diaj","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/diaj","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/diaj","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 615 89 16 13","address":"Résidence Madicréole, 97221 Le Carbet","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Chèques bancaires et postaux","Espèces","Virement bancaire"],"website":"https://www.diaj-plongee.fr/","languages":["Anglais","Espagnol","Français"],"priceRange":"45 €"}},{"id":230,"name":"An Dlo","type":"activity","lat":14.47420771,"lng":-61.0074573,"location":"Le Diamant","description":"A dive club on a small fishermen''s beach, ten minutes from Diamond Rock, diving one of the best sites in the area in a friendly, safe atmosphere, plus commented outings with a swim from its boat.",