nce boat experience from Anse Mitan in Les Trois-Îlets for up to 10 people, mixing barbecue, swimming, relaxing and an aperitif. The outing can be personalised with a floating mat, pool or floating bar, and the boats are easy to drive.","description_fr":"Une sortie en bateau sans permis au départ de l’anse Mitan, aux Trois-Îlets, pour 10 personnes au plus : barbecue, baignade, détente et apéritif. On personnalise la sortie avec un tapis flottant, une piscine ou un bar flottant ; les bateaux sont faciles à piloter.","tags":["Boat Trip"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/donuts-bbq-chill","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/donuts-bbq-chill","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/donuts-bbq-chill","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/donuts-bbq-chill","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/donuts-bbq-chill","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/donuts-bbq-chill","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 69 60 72","address":"Anse-Mitan, 97229 Les Trois-Ilets","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces","Paypal","Virement bancaire"],"languages":["Français"],"priceRange":"165 €"},"opening_periods":[{"day":0,"opens":540,"closes":1260},{"day":1,"opens":540,"closes":1260},{"day":2,"opens":540,"closes":1260},{"day":3,"opens":540,"closes":1260},{"day":4,"opens":540,"closes":1260},{"day":5,"opens":540,"closes":1260},{"day":6,"op