"Espèces"],"website":"https://www.dreamcatcher972.fr/","languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"40–150 €"}},{"id":233,"name":"Dream Yacht Caribbean","type":"activity","lat":14.4692975,"lng":-60.86445,"location":"Le Marin","description":"A sailing cruise starting from the quiet anchorage of Le Marin, exploring the Caribbean with calls at Bequia, Mustique, Mayreau and the Tobago Cays, snorkelling in pristine lagoons and visiting picturesque villages, with stops in Saint Lucia and Sainte-Anne.","description_fr":"Une croisière qui part du mouillage tranquille du Marin pour explorer la Caraïbe, avec des escales à Bequia, Mustique, Mayreau et aux Tobago Cays, du snorkeling dans des lagons immaculés et la visite de villages pittoresques, ainsi que des passages à Sainte-Lucie et à Sainte-Anne.","tags":["Boat Trip"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/dream-yacht-caribbean","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Telephone","Address","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/dream-yacht-caribbean","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/dream-yacht-caribbean","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/dream-yacht-caribbean","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/dream-yacht-caribbean","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/dream-yacht-caribbean","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 74 81 68","address":"97290 Le Marin","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces","Virement bancaire"],"langua