:"activity","lat":14.5766083,"lng":-60.855644,"location":"Le Vauclin","description":"Eco-excursions along the Atlantic coast in transparent canoes with a guide, over reefs, sandbanks, mangrove lagoons and seagrass beds chosen for their beauty, with playful, educational activities. The same trip is offered on a solar boat for 4 to 6 people.","description_fr":"Des éco-excursions en pirogues transparentes avec un guide le long du littoral atlantique, sur des parcours choisis pour leur beauté : récifs coralliens, bancs de sable, lagons de mangrove et herbiers, avec des animations ludiques et pédagogiques. La même excursion est possible sur un bateau solaire de 4 à 6 personnes.","tags":["Kayak"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/fleurdo-ecoexcursion","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/fleurdo-ecoexcursion","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/fleurdo-ecoexcursion","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/fleurdo-ecoexcursion","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/fleurdo-ecoexcursion","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/fleurdo-ecoexcursion","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/fleurdo-ecoexcursion","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/fleurdo-ecoex