":"Les Trois-Îlets","description":"A young company offering a turnkey way to discover Martinique aboard brand-new boats that combine comfort and safety, to enjoy the island''s coasts and clear waters.","description_fr":"Une jeune entreprise qui propose une formule clé en main pour découvrir la Martinique en bateau neuf, confortable et sûr, et profiter de ses côtes et de ses eaux transparentes.","tags":["Boat Trip"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/land-and-sea","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Website","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/land-and-sea","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/land-and-sea","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/land-and-sea","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/land-and-sea","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/land-and-sea","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"address":"La Pointe des Pères, 97229 Les Trois-Ilets","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Chèques bancaires et postaux","Virement bancaire"],"website":"https://www.landandsea.fr/","languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"380–570 €"},"opening_periods":[{"day":0,"opens":480,"closes":1140},{"day":1,"opens":480,"closes":1140},{"day":2,"opens":480,"closes":1140},{"day":3,"opens":480,"closes":1140},{"day":4,"opens":480,"closes":1140},{"day":5,"opens":480,"closes":1140},{"day":6,"opens":480,"closes":1140}],"hours_source":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nau