chool & 50° Excursion Bateau","type":"activity","lat":14.58527914,"lng":-60.8506825,"location":"Le François","description":"A water-sports base with a wakeboard school (lessons, courses and sessions) and tailor-made boat excursions to the islets, white shallows and lagoons of Le François and the Vauclin mangrove, with outings to discover the environment and lunch with a local family on an islet.","description_fr":"Une école de wakeboard (cours, stages, sessions) adossée à une base nautique qui organise aussi des excursions à la carte : îlets du François, ses lagons et fonds blancs, mangrove du Vauclin, avec déjeuner chez l’habitant sur un îlet.","tags":["Water Sports"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/mada-wake-school-50deg-excursion-bateau","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Opening hours","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/mada-wake-school-50deg-excursion-bateau","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/mada-wake-school-50deg-excursion-bateau","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/mada-wake-school-50deg-excursion-bateau","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/mada-wake-school-50deg-excursion-bateau","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/mada-wake-school-50deg-excursion-bateau","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"hoursText":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/mada-wake-school-50deg-excursion-bateau","checkedAt":"202