 for children and adults.","description_fr":"Le premier téléski nautique de toute la Caraïbe, au domaine Château Gaillard, sur la route des Trois-Îlets : des professionnels initient et perfectionnent au wakeboard dans une base de loisirs arborée, pour petits et grands.","tags":["Wakeboarding","Water Sports"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/martinique-wake-park","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/martinique-wake-park","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/martinique-wake-park","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/martinique-wake-park","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/martinique-wake-park","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/martinique-wake-park","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/martinique-wake-park","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/martinique-wake-park","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 69 46 21","address":"Domaine Chateau Gaillard, 97229 Les Trois-Ilets","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Chèques vacances","Virement bancaire"],"website":"https://www.martiniquewakepark.com/","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/martiniquewakepark","languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"7–26 €"},"opening_periods":[{"day":0,"open