ive centre in Saint-Pierre exploring the north Caribbean seabed, with canyons, coral plateaus and drop-offs and encounters with hawksbill turtles, as well as the mythical Roraima wreck sunk in the 1902 eruption.","description_fr":"Un centre de plongée de Saint-Pierre, pour explorer les fonds du nord Caraïbe, riches en faune et en flore : canyons, plateaux de corail, tombants, tortues imbriquées. Au programme aussi, l’épave mythique du Roraima, englouti en 1902 lors de l’éruption de la Pelée.","tags":["Diving"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/papa-dlo","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/papa-dlo","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/papa-dlo","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/papa-dlo","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/papa-dlo","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/papa-dlo","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/papa-dlo","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/papa-dlo","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 628 41 83 58","address":"104 Rue Bouillé, 97250 Saint-Pierre","payment":["Chèques bancaires et postaux","Espèces","Virement bancaire"],"website":"https://apapadlo.net/","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/checkpoint","instagram":"https://instagram.com/a.papadlo.plongee.martinique","languages":["Anglais","Français"]}},{"id":290,"name":"Plongee  Immersion Caraibes","type":"activity","lat":14.46983364,"lng":-60.8659309,"location":"Le Marin","description":"A dive centre at the Le Marin marina, a starting point for sites across the far south of the Caribbean coast up to Diamond Rock. Open to divers and non-divers: introductory dives, diver training (French diving school and SSI) and children''s diving from age 5–6.","description_fr":"Un centre de plongée à la marina du Marin, point de départ vers les sites du grand sud caraïbe jusqu’au Rocher du Diamant. Ouvert aux plongeurs comme aux non-plongeurs : baptêmes, formation de plongeur (École française de plongée, SSI) et plongée enfant dès 5-6 ans.","tags":["Diving"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/plongee-immersion-caraibes","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/plongee-immersion-caraibes","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/plongee-immersion-caraibes","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/plongee-immersion-caraibes","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/plongee-immersion-caraibes","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"facebook":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/plongee-immersion-caraibes","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/plongee-immersion-caraibes","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages