n","type":"activity","lat":14.4676277,"lng":-60.939086,"location":"Sainte-Luce","description":"Half-day canyoning in tropical forest at some of Martinique''s finest canyons, with optional jumps, abseiling initiation, slides and short approach walks, with talk on wildlife and plants.","description_fr":"Du canyoning en demi-journée dans la forêt tropicale, sur certains des plus beaux canyons de l’île : sauts facultatifs, initiation au rappel, toboggans et petites marches d’approche, avec des explications sur la faune et la flore.","tags":["Canyoning"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/tropicanyon","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Social media","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken","Opening hours"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/tropicanyon","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/tropicanyon","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/tropicanyon","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/tropicanyon","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"instagram":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/tropicanyon","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/tropicanyon","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/tropicanyon","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 630 26 08 44","address":"52 Zac de Pont Café, Corps de Garde, 97228 Sainte-Luce","payment":["Chèques bancaires et postaux","Espèces","Virement bancaire"],"website":"