-nautiques/turquoise-evasion-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/turquoise-evasion-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/turquoise-evasion-martinique","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 696 80 43 64","address":"Ponton de l''ADAM, chemin de l''îlet,, 97231 Le Robert","payment":["Chèques bancaires et postaux","Espèces","Virement bancaire"],"website":"https://www.turquoiseevasionmartinique.com/","languages":["Anglais","Espagnol","Français"]}},{"id":309,"name":"Two Thou","type":"activity","lat":14.5574074,"lng":-61.053109,"location":"Les Trois-Îlets","description":"Sport fishing off Pointe du Bout, a kind of sea safari for anglers and thrill-seekers that needs good fitness: strapped into a chair, technique and energy are needed to hook very strong fish.","description_fr":"De la pêche sportive au large de la Pointe du Bout, sorte de safari en mer pour pêcheurs et amateurs de sensations, qui demande une bonne condition physique : sanglé dans un fauteuil, il faut technique et énergie pour ferrer des poissons parfois très puissants.","tags":["Fishing"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/two-thou","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/two-thou","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/two-thou","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-activites-nautiques/two-thou","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/q