,"location":"Le François","description":"A riding club opened in September 2007 with modern facilities: a clubhouse with a large terrace over the upper arena, pony and horse stables, a large arena and a big car park. It also offers rides in nature.","description_fr":"Un club d’équitation ouvert en septembre 2007, aux installations modernes : club-house avec grande terrasse dominant la carrière haute, écuries de poneys et de chevaux, grande carrière et vaste parking. Il propose aussi des balades en pleine nature.","tags":["Horse Riding"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-et-decouvertes-terre/equilibrecentre-equestre-du-francois","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone","Website","Opening hours","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-et-decouvertes-terre/equilibrecentre-equestre-du-francois","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"address":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-et-decouvertes-terre/equilibrecentre-equestre-du-francois","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"payment":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-et-decouvertes-terre/equilibrecentre-equestre-du-francois","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"website":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-et-decouvertes-terre/equilibrecentre-equestre-du-francois","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"hoursText":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-et-decouvertes-terre/equilibrecentre-equestre-du-francois","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"languages":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-et-decouvertes-terre/equilibrecentre-equestre-du-francois","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"},"priceRange":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-et-decouvertes-terre/equilibrecentre-equestre-du-francois","checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}},"phone":"+596 596 55 00 05","address":"Quartier Reunion Bellegarde, 97240 Le François","payment":["Cartes bancaires","Espèces","Virement bancaire"],"website":"https://www.equilibre-martinique.com/","hoursText":"Lundi : À partir de 08h30, À partir de 19h30\nMardi : À partir de 08h30, À partir de 19h30\nMercredi : À partir de 08h30, À partir de 19h30\nJeudi : À partir de 08h30, À partir de 19h30\nVendredi : À partir de 08h30, À partir de 19h30\nSamedi : À partir de 08h30, À partir de 19h30","languages":["Anglais","Français"],"priceRange":"10–1206 €"}},{"id":327,"name":"Excursion Mer Et Nature . Martinique Merveilleuse","type":"activity","lat":14.615346,"lng":-60.902688,"location":"Le François","description":"An all-inclusive day exploring the finest sites of the Atlantic and Caribbean coasts: mangrove and Joséphine''s Bath with accras and ti-punch, a guided visit of the iguana islet, swimming and aperitif on white shallows, coral seabeds and a Creole lunch at Îlet Madame; or, on the Caribbean side, dolphins and sperm whales.","description_fr":"Journée tout compris sur les plus beaux sites des deux côtés de l’île. Au programme côté atlantique : la mangrove, la baignoire de Joséphine (accras, ti-punch, cocktail de fruits), l’îlet aux iguanes avec un guide, un bain et un apéro sur fonds blancs, les fonds coralliens, puis un repas créole à l’îlet Madame, les pieds dans l’eau. Côté caraïbe : dauphins et cachalots.","tags":["Boat Trip"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-et-decouvertes-terre/excursion-mer-et-nature-martinique-merveilleuse","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Telephone","Address","Website","Price range","Payment","Languages spoken"],"checkedAt":"2026-10-02"}],"access":"unknown","published":true,"details":{"from":{"phone":{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sports-et-decouvertes-terre/excursion-mer-et-nature-martinique-merveilleuse","checkedAt":"202